URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/birthday-celebration-for-paramhansa-
 yogananda/
SUMMARY:Birthday Celebration for Paramhansa Yogananda
DESCRIPTION:Paramhansa Yogananda was born in India on January 5\, 1893.  H
 e came as an avatar for this age\, to change the consciousness of the plan
 et.\n\nThis evening will be an event of devotion and great joy as we remem
 ber our guru. There will be music\, readings\, stories\, chants and medita
 tion. A slideshow will be shared.\n\nAll are welcome\, whether you are a d
 isciple or new to this path.\n\nThe event is free\, but an offering will b
 e part of the evening.\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 20/12/Yogananda-Master-The-Ananda-Master-photo-292x400-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Devotional Event
LOCATION:Ananda Temple and Teaching Center\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton
 \, OR\, 97005\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaver
 ton\, OR\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Temple 
 and Teaching Center:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
