URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/blood-drive-at-the-temple/
SUMMARY:Blood Drive at the Temple
DESCRIPTION:National Blood Shortage\nThe Red Cross national blood supply ha
 s fallen by about 25% since early August. Right now\, blood product distri
 butions to hospitals are outpacing the number of blood donations coming in
 .\n\nYou can help and come to the Portland Temple to give blood! The Red C
 ross will be there with a bloodmobile in the parking lot all day. Please r
 eserve your spot now. \n\nIf you have questions you can contact Hanuman a
 t hanuman.baughman@gmail.com \n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 23/09/2021-july-news-medical-city-weatherford-hosts-blood-drive-to-aid-cri
 tical-need-400x400-1.jpg
