URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/yoga-and-the-chakras-with-melissa/
SUMMARY:A Journey Through the Chakras\; a Yoga Retreat to Restore Your Soul
DESCRIPTION:Chakra is a Sanskrit word that literally means “wheel” or 
 “circle.” In a deeper\, spiritual sense\, the word describes the whirl
 pools or vortices of energy located along the central axis of our bodies\,
  in the astral or energy spine that underlies the physical backbone.\n\nTh
 ere are six nerve centers or chakras in the astral spine. An upward flow
  of energy through the chakras accompanies divine awakening\, while a dow
 nward flow of energy signals attachment to matter and a darkening effect o
 n one’s consciousness.  PY\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nYoga is not just about stretch
 ing - it is also about directing energy and increasing our awareness of th
 e flow of energy in the spine.\n\nThe chakras are energy centers in our as
 tral spine. Yoga can help us become more aware of our chakras\, and help u
 s increase the flow of energy to and through these great centers of energy
 . The chakras hold our karma and the key to spiritual freedom.\nPractice H
 atha and Restorative poses infused with live music and meditation. \nPrer
 egistration is required - please purchase ticket below. Fee is sliding sca
 le $20 - $50.\n\n&nbsp\;\nLed by Melissa Heart AYTT\, Wendy Chapler AYTT\,
  and Janice Fairlee\, Harpist\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 23/11/Chakras-768x498-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,workshop,Yoga
LOCATION:Ananda Temple and Teaching Center\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton
 \, OR\, 97005\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaver
 ton\, OR\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Temple 
 and Teaching Center:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
