URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/pilgrimage-slideshow-with-sitabai/
SUMMARY:Pilgrimage Slideshow with Sitabai
DESCRIPTION:Join Sitabai Betts on a delightful virtual pilgrimage to the Ca
 mino de Santiago in Spain and the St. Francis Pilgrimage in Italy. She'll 
 share highlights from the September 2023 Camino Pilgrimage\, as well as pi
 ctures of the St. Francis pilgrimage trail that she walked in November. 
  Whether you might have an interest in joining a future pilgrimage or sim
 ply want to join us for a fun evening and a taste of spiritual adventure\,
  this slideshow will be filled with joyful inspiration!\n\nFREE\n\nHeld at
  the Ananda Portland Community following the community meal.\n\n(If you wi
 sh to join us for the meal\, reservations are required. $7 per person.) Co
 ntact Lorna@anandaportland.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
LOCATION:Ananda Community\, 7020 SW Vermont Court\, Portland\, Oregon\, 972
 23\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=7020 SW Vermont Court\, Por
 tland\, Oregon\, 97223\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda C
 ommunity:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
