BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3001215@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240214T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240214T180000
DTSTAMP:20240130T054220Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/change-your-life-for-more-success-an
 d-happiness/
SUMMARY:Change Your Life For More Success and Happiness
DESCRIPTION:This is an online course offered through Ananda College.\n\nReg
 ister Online Here\n\nThis online course is an ideal way to bring positive 
 change into your life. Using the power of affirmation\, the instructors wi
 ll work together to help you create a dynamic change for the New Year. The
 y use innovative exercises\, to help you develop your intuition and to cre
 ate your own powerful affirmations.\n\nThis is a workshop program versus a
  lecture program. This means that people will develop practical skills as 
 well as an understanding of the theory and context of affirmations.\n\nYou
  can learn to:\n\n 	Remove blocks to your Success and Happiness\n 	Target 
 areas you'd like to improve in your life\n 	Know the power of your thought
 s\n 	Change your negative thought patterns\n 	Uncover hidden blockages to 
 your personal growth\n 	Learn how your body and mind work together\n 	Deve
 lop your intuition\n 	Recognize and change habit patterns\n 	Create and ef
 fectively use your own personal affirmations\n\nThe class series will meet
  online on Wednesdays\, once a week for 4 weeks from Feb 14th to Mar 6th\,
  2024\n\nClass size: limited to 12 participants\n\nCost: $37.00\n\nInstruc
 tors are Karin and David LaBriere\n\nWhat former students say:\n\n“My li
 fe has completely changed since using my affirmations\, thank you\nDavid!
 ” Pam B.\n\n“… so grateful to David for his insightful (help) to tra
 in my mind to\nthink in important and positive ways.” Don S.\n\n\n\n\n\n
 &nbsp\;\n\nRegister online HERE
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/01/affirmations-class-featured.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,workshop
LOCATION:https://anandacollege.org/courses/change-your-life-for-more-succes
 s-happiness/
END:VEVENT
