 ton\, OR\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Temple 
 and Teaching Center:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3000869@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240217T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240217T120000
DTSTAMP:20231103T043629Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/meditation-workshop-3/
SUMMARY:Meditation Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Learn the ancient science of meditation taught by Paramhansa Yo
 gananda in this 2 hour workshop. Meditation is a tool for transformation a
 nd spiritual growth that will affect every part of your life\, as you disc
 over calmness and inner peace.\n\nYou will learn:\n\n 	How to sit and keep
  the body still\n 	Where to focus your attention\n 	The Hong Sau technique
  of concentration that is the first step on the path of kriya yoga\n 	How 
 to begin a regular meditation practice and how to keep up your practice\n 
 	Ways to incorporate meditation into your daily (and busy!) life\n 	Resour
 ces you can draw on after this class\n\nIncluded: a meditation manual\n\nT
 aught by an experienced meditator and devotee of Paramhansa Yogananda\, wi
 th years of experience to share. After class\, we are happy to support you
 r ongoing meditation practice.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 19/07/group-Meditation-image-cropped.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,Meditation
LOCATION:Ananda Temple and Teaching Center\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton
 \, OR\, 97005\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaver
 ton\, OR\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Temple 
 and Teaching Center:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3001205@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240217T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240217T160000
DTSTAMP:20240215T204041Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/radiant-relationships-a-yogic-approa
 ch-to-love/
SUMMARY:Radiant Relationships: A Yogic Approach to Love
DESCRIPTION:Drawing from the wisdom of Paramhansa Yogananda\, this workshop
  delves into the profound connection between love and Self-realization. To
 gether\, we will explore practical insights from yoga to nurture love on a
 ll levels—physical\, emotional\, mental\, and spiritual.\n\nJoin us to r
 evitalize your relationships and rejuvenate your heart\, gaining new persp
 ectives and tools to cultivate profound and transformative love in all its
  forms.\n\nTaught by Badri and Gita Matlock\n\n\nBadri and Gita Matlock ar
 e a couple dedicated to living the teachings of Paramhansa Yogananda and b
 uilding the dynamic spiritual community of Ananda. With 14 years of leader
 ship at Ananda Village\, Badri now serves on Ananda Portland's ministry an
 d community management teams\, sharing yoga\, meditation\, and music to up
 lift others. He finds special joy in family\, adventure\, surfing\, and fr
 iendships. Together with Gita\, their children Tulsi and Jay\, and rescue 
 dog Boon\, they call Ananda Portland home.\nGita\, raised in Ananda Villag
 e\, explores yoga’s applications in relationships\, business\, nature\, 
 and her passion—horses. Combining nonprofit management expertise\, equin
 e assisted learning\, and yogic principles\, she drives meaningful change 
 inside and out. Together\, Badri and Gita share spiritual wisdom and exper
 iential learning\, nurturing growth in individuals and communities.\n&nbsp
 \;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/01/Relationships-pic.jpg
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaver
 ton\, OR\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Portlan
 d Temple:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
