URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/inner-renewal-week-online-viewing-20
 24-02-19/
SUMMARY:Inner Renewal Retreat online viewing
DESCRIPTION:Inner Renewal is an annual tradition at Ananda Village. Many t
 ravel to participate in the retreat in person.  We can view the morning c
 lasses online in our temple in Portland.\n\nJoin us for viewing these insp
 iring talks by Ananda's leading teachers.\n\nCome each morning\, or for th
 e classes you are able to attend. You can also sign up and pay for the ent
 ire week's activities and enjoy it all from your home.\nInformation can be
  found here:  Inner Renewal Retreat 2024\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nTheme for 2024:  
 Embrace Your Dharma\; Your Path to Liberation\n\nThe spiritual path leads 
 us home to our own true Self. During our annual Inner Renewal Retreat\, de
 votees from around the world join together to dive more deeply into the sp
 irit and practices of Yogananda’s teachings – renewing and deepening o
 ur inner life.\n\n\n\nLed by Ananda Worldwide Spiritual Directors Nayaswam
 i Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 20/03/JD_Pronamcropped.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes
LOCATION:Ananda Temple and Teaching Center\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton
 \, OR\, 97005\, United States
