DTSTAMP:20240208T024700Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/inner-renewal-2024-morning-class/
SUMMARY:Inner Renewal 2024 Morning Class
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClasses by Ananda's Spiritual Directors\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\nNayaswami Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi speak from over 50 years of p
 ersonal experience in living Paramhansa Yogananda’s teachings. Their cla
 sses are known for their depth\, practicality\, and humor.\n\n\nWatch the 
 morning classes with Jyotish and Devi at the Portland temple. Drop in and 
 join us for this inspirational week of Inner Renewal.\n\n\n\nFour Days of 
 Spiritual Rejuvenation - Inner Renewal 2024\n\n\n\n\nFind answers to your 
 deep spiritual questions and needs. Be inspired to discard limiting habits
  and manifest your goals. Feel blessed by a tangible divine presence.\n\nC
 lasses will be shown at the Portland Temple\n\n10:30 - 12   Monday - Thu
 rsday\n\nMonday's topic: What is our dharma?\n\nTuesday's topic: Dharmic a
 ction leads to spiritual freedom.\n\nWednesday's topic: Living with dharma
  in today's world.\n\nThursday's topic: How I find and follow my dharma.\n
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 16/05/JD_Pronam-768x512.jpg
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
