DESCRIPTION:For Ananda Kriyabans and Kriya Initiates Only\n\nKriyacharyas:
   Nayaswami Hriman and Surendra Conti\n\nSchedule:\n\n4 - 5 PM Meditation
 \n\n5 PM: Front doors are locked\n\n5 - 7 PM: Ceremony\n\nPlease bring a f
 lower\, fruit and offering for the initiation. Wear white\, if possible.\n
 \nIf you have questions\, please call 503-626-3403 or email portland@anand
 aportland.org\n\nPreregistration is required to attend. Please contact por
 tland@anandaportland.org\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nA kriya review for kriyabans will b
 e offered on Sunday 3/3 at 8:30 AM. No registration required. Come to the 
 temple and meet in the Inspiration classroom.\n\nNayaswami Hriman is a kri
 yacharya and Spiritual Director of Ananda Washington. We are pleased to ha
 ve him with us for this kriya initiation.\n\n\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nb
 sp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nSurendra Conti is a kr
 iyacharya and co-Spiritual Director of Ananda Portland.\n\n\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n
 &nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
