URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/mahasamadhi-of-sri-yukteswar-and-par
 amhansa-yogananda/
SUMMARY:Mahasamadhi of Sri Yukteswar and Paramhansa Yogananda
DESCRIPTION:"Mahasamadhi" means the great samadhi\, or conscious exit from 
 the physical body that marks the end of an avatar's incarnation.\n\nSwami 
 Sri Yukteswar left his body on March 9\, 1936 and Paramhansa Yogananda lef
 t his body on March 7\, 1952. Tonight we celebrate and remember these two 
 great avatars with readings\, music\, chanting\, meditation and devotion.\
 n\nAll are welcome to join us as we tune into the infinite consciousness o
 f these free souls who changed the world and are drawing all sincere seeke
 rs back to union with the divine.\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/02/Mahasamadhi-SY-PY.jpg
