SUMMARY:Communing with Aum in Nature
DESCRIPTION:Join visiting Ananda minister and world-renowned nature educato
 r Sundara Traymar for a special program blending nature awareness activiti
 es and the powerful expression of God in nature as AUM\, the sacred sound.
  Hiking in the serene trails of the scenic Hoyt Arboretum\, Sundara will l
 ead our group through a series of practices to deepen our awareness of the
  Divine in nature\, and in ourselves.\n\n[caption id="attachment_16557998"
  align="alignleft" width="350"] Hoyt Arboretum's magical Redwood Forest[/c
 aption]\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\
 n\n\n\nSundara is an international teacher and nature educator with decade
 s of experience in his field. Learn more about Sundara here.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\
 n \n\n 
