SUMMARY:Swami Kriyananda Moksha Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Swami Kriyananda\, founder of Ananda\, left his body and obtain
 ed Moksha\, or divine freedom\, on April 21\, 2013.\n\nToday we celebrate
  the life of Swami Kriyananda and his spiritual freedom.\n\nJoin us at Sun
 day Service and a group meditation at the Ananda Portland Community.\n\nTh
 e meditation will be held at the community chapel 4:30 - 5:45 PM\, followe
 d by the community meal.
