 vi/
SUMMARY:Visit from Nayaswamis Jyotish and Devi
DESCRIPTION:Nayaswamis Jyotish and Devi\, Spiritual Directors of Ananda Wor
 ldwide\, are great devotees who spent many years under the guidance of Swa
 mi Kriyananda\, a direct disciple of Paramhansa Yogananda and founder of A
 nanda. They now lead the movement of Ananda across the world and are divin
 e friends to thousands of disciples and truth seekers who follow this path
  of Self-Realization.\n\nSave these dates to spend time with these wonderf
 ul souls. More information will be added as the plans for this visit come 
 together.
