URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/divine-mother-tea-and-garden-tour/
SUMMARY:Divine Mother Tea and Garden Tour
DESCRIPTION:\n\nThis wonderful opportunity is a fundraiser event for Ananda
  Portland. This will involve time at the beautiful and sacred grounds of T
 he Grotto Sanctuary in NE Portland.\n\nA walk in the upper gardens with ti
 me at the shrines accompanied by Ananda musicians singing and playing song
 s by Swami Kriyananda will be followed by a catered tea with Nayaswamis Jy
 otish and Devi in a private space on The Grotto grounds.\n\n[caption id="a
 ttachment_16557963" align="aligncenter" width="350"] The Grotto\, NE Portl
 and\, OR[/caption]\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nTickets are $150 per person\, or $250
 /couple. Register and pay below for this special morning.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/02/Mother2smaller-scaled-e1709236506351.jpg
CATEGORIES:Devotional Event,fundraiser,Guest Speakers
LOCATION:The Grotto\, 8840 NE Skidmore Street\, Portland\, Oregon\, 97220\,
  United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=8840 NE Skidmore Street\, P
 ortland\, Oregon\, 97220\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=The Gr
 otto:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3001240@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240427T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240427T203000
DTSTAMP:20240406T052244Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/kriya-yoga-and-spiritual-community-w
 ith-nayaswamis-jyotish-and-devi/
SUMMARY:Kriya Yoga and Spiritual Community with Nayaswamis Jyotish and Devi
DESCRIPTION:Ananda Portland is delighted and honored to have the Spiritual 
 Directors of Ananda Sangha Worldwide here for a special weekend of events.
 \n\n[caption id="attachment_24913" align="alignright" width="256"] Joy is 
 Within You symbol at Ananda Village\, California[/caption]\n\nNayaswami Jy
 otish and Nayaswami Devi are lifelong disciples of Paramhansa Yogananda an
 d studied for decades with Yogananda's direct disciple\, Swami Kriyananda.
  They live at the first Ananda community in Nevada City\, California\, fou
 nded in 1969.\n\nThey travel the world as emissaries of Paramhansa Yoganan
 da and serve the light as United Nations Global Peace Ambassadors. Living 
 examples of spiritual values in action\, Jyotish and Devi share Yogananda
 ’s teachings and bless people with the practical and heart-opening path 
 of Kriya Yoga as warm and compassionate speakers and authors.\n\nBoth Naya
 swami Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi were named kriyacharyas and spiritual d
 irectors of Ananda Sangha Worldwide by Swami Kriyananda\, founder of Anand
 a\, many years prior to his transition. Swami Kriyananda named Nayasawami 
 Jyotish as his successor\, Dharmacharya of Ananda Sangha Worldwide.\n\nTh
 is special evening at our Ananda Portland temple and teaching center will 
 include music and Jyotish &amp\; Devi sharing their experiences of 50+ yea
 rs living in spiritual community\, with Swami Kriyananda\, and how communi
 ty is a central principle in Yogananda's teachings and the path of Kriya Y
 oga.\n\nSome time will be given to Questions and Answers\, book signing an
 d meeting with Jyotish &amp\; Devi\, and all are invited to stay for compl
 imentary refreshments after the talk.\n\nYou can learn more about Jyotish 
 and Devi HERE. \n\nWhile this event is FREE\, pre-registration is appreci
 ated. We hope to see you there.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 20/03/JD_Pronamcropped.jpg
CATEGORIES:Community,Guest Speakers,Kriya
LOCATION:Ananda Temple in Beaverton\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, O
 regon\, 97005\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Bea
 verton\, Oregon\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda 
 Temple in Beaverton:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
