URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/rajarsi-community-seva-day/
SUMMARY:Rajarsi Community Seva Day
DESCRIPTION:Rajarsi day is an annual event held at the community. Named for
  the foremost disciple of Paramhansa Yogananda\, to whom he gave the name 
 \, Rajarsi Janakananda. We spend the morning in joyful service and then sh
 are a delicious lunch.\n\nAll are welcome to join us in this day of commun
 ity fellowship. We will be working outdoors\, no matter the weather. The t
 asks will be for all skill levels and the goal is to beautify our communit
 y environment and to build divine friendships.\n\nSchedule:\n\n8:30 coffee
  and light snacks\n\n8:45 opening circle and breakdown of tasks\n\n9:00 Se
 va begins!\n\n12:30 meditation\n\n1:00 Vegetarian Lunch:  Veggie burgers 
 and dogs with potluck salads and desserts\n\nAfter lunch - clean up and re
 lax\n\nCall Lorna with questions: 971-219-0767\n\nAddress: 7020 SW Vermont
  Court\, Portland\, 97223\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 17/04/Rajarsi_lotus.jpg
CATEGORIES:Community,Community Service,Family Friendly,Service &amp;
 Satsangs
LOCATION:Ananda Community\, 7020 SW Vermont Court\, Portland\, Oregon\, 972
 23\, United States
