URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/kirtan-in-the-community/
SUMMARY:Kirtan in the Community
DESCRIPTION:Our monthly kirtans continue outside at the community during th
 e summer.\n\n\n\nGuests Naryayani and Shurjo\, from Ananda Mumbai\, will b
 e joining us for this month's kirtan.\n\nThese are free events and open to
  all. Bring a blanket to sit on if you like to sit on the grass\, and enjo
 y the devotion.\n\nBe mindful of the weather and the change in temperature
  as the sun goes down.\n\nMost chants are in English and words are provide
 d. We have brief periods of meditation between chants and at the end of th
 e evening.\n\nWe hope to see you there!
