URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/my-heart-remembers-swami-kriyananda-
 satsang-with-tyagi-shurjo-and-tyagi-narayani/
SUMMARY:My Heart Remembers Swami Kriyananda: Satsang with Shurjo and Naraya
 ni
DESCRIPTION:Narayani and Shurjo will share their experiences of being close
  companions of Swami Kriyananda during the last years of his life\, and ho
 w they continue to be guided and blessed by his presence today.\n\nThese g
 reat souls are part of the leadership of Ananda Worldwide and spend their 
 days sharing the teachings of Yogananda and Kriyananda with all. They are 
 bright and vibrant teachers\, loving friends\, and they radiate divine joy
 .\n\nThis evening will be an inspiring discussion\, with an opportunity fo
 r Q &amp\; A with Narayani and Shurjo.\n\nAll are welcome - FREE\n\n&nbsp\
 ;\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/04/surjo-narayani-1-350x337-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,Guest Speakers
