URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/sunday-service-with-tyagi-shurjo-and
 -tyagi-narayani/
SUMMARY:Sunday Service with Tyagi Shurjo and Tyagi Narayani
DESCRIPTION:Today we have guest ministers from Ananda Mumbai.  Tyagi Shurj
 o and Tyagi Narayani are the Spiritual Directors of Ananda's work in Mumba
 i\, on an extended visit to the US. Both of them spent years with the foun
 der of Ananda\, Swami Kriyananda\, and have travelled extensively serving 
 Ananda Worldwide.\n\nGifted speakers\, teachers\, musicians\, and deep dev
 otees of Paramhansa Yogananda\, Narayani and Shurjo are rare visitors to P
 ortland. Don't miss this opportunity to be with them.\n\n&nbsp\;
