URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/learn-to-meditate-i-concentration-7-
 2024-07-10/
SUMMARY:Learn to Meditate I: Concentration
DESCRIPTION:This 3 week series of 1 hour classes will give you what you nee
 d to embark on your meditation journey. The content will include:\n\n 	Sev
 eral relaxation and pranayam techniques for the body\n 	Ancient yogic tech
 niques for focusing the mind.\n 	Practices for opening the heart and expan
 ding awareness.\n 	Universal tools for making spiritual progress now.\n\nT
 his is the first step on the path of Kriya Yoga as taught by Paramhansa Yo
 gananda.\n\n$25 for all three classes with an experienced meditator and di
 sciple of Yogananda.\n\n*If you are not able to register for the class bel
 ow\, please call us and let us know you are interested.  503-626-3403
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 20/07/Group-Meditations.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,Meditation
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
