URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/india-festival-in-beaverton/
SUMMARY:India Festival in Beaverton
DESCRIPTION:This event will be held in Beaverton\, across the street from t
 he Ananda Temple.  Ananda will have a booth and a short presentation as p
 art of the festival. There will be many fun activities and new friends to 
 discover. Come to the Ananda service and then spend time in the park at th
 e festival.\n\n*Please be aware of traffic and parking conditions at the t
 emple on this day. \n\nFor more information about the festival\, check th
 e ICA website. \nIndia Cultural Association of Portland (ICA) is a non-pr
 ofit organization dedicated to enhancing Indian cultural awareness in Port
 land\, Oregon. Established in 1980\, ICA brings the entire Indian communit
 y together and provides a venue for people to reconnect with their roots.\
 nIn August of every year\, ICA hosts the popular India Festival in Portlan
 d\, Oregon\, to celebrate India’s Independence Day. The all-day festival
  attracts over 10\,000 visitors from all backgrounds. It never fails to de
 light with a fusion of free live music\, dance\, food\, and entertainment!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/04/dancer-4.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Community,Family Friendly
LOCATION:Ananda Temple in Beaverton\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, O
 regon\, 97005\, United States
