URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/blood-drive-at-the-temple-2/
SUMMARY:Blood Drive at the Temple
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\nHello all\,\n\nAnanda Church and the American Red Cross
  are hosting an upcoming blood drive.\n\nPlease join our lifesaving missio
 n and schedule an appointment today!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDrive Details:\nSite
 : Ananda Church\nAddress: 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 97005\nR
 oom Name: American Red Cross Bloodmobile\nDate: Tue Aug 13\, 2024\nTime:
  10:00 AM - 03:00 PM\nBlood Program Leader Name: Kent Baughman\nBlood Pr
 ogram Leader Phone Number:\nClick here to make an appointment\n\nDear Frie
 nds\,\n\nPlease go to redcrossblood.org to register for our drive! Blessi
 ngs\, Hanuman\n\nThe need for blood is constant and only volunteer donors 
 can fulfill that need for patients in our community. Nationwide\, someone 
 needs a unit of blood every 2 to 3 seconds and most of us will need blood 
 in our lifetime.\n\nThank you for supporting the American Red Cross blood 
 program!\n\nDownload the Red Cross Blood Donor App on the App Store\, Go
 ogle Play or text BLOODAPP to 90999. Schedule appointments\, view your bl
 ood type and results of your mini-physical\, and track your donations.\n\n
 \n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 23/09/2021-july-news-medical-city-weatherford-hosts-blood-drive-to-aid-cri
 tical-need-400x400-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Community Service
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
