URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/satsang-with-asha-nayaswami-author-o
 f-lightbearer/
SUMMARY:Satsang with Asha Nayaswami\, author of Lightbearer
DESCRIPTION:We are very happy to welcome Asha back to Portland after many y
 ears. She has been travelling the globe teaching on behalf of Swami Kriyan
 anda\, making friends and sharing the light of truth as taught be Paramhan
 sa Yogananda.\n\nAsha is a lifelong disciple of Paramhansa Yogananda and w
 as a student of Swami Kriyananda's for 45 years. She is author of the book
 \, Swami Kriyananda: Lightbearer\, as well as other books about the spirit
 ual path.\n\n\n\nTonight will be an informal discussion of her recent trav
 els to several continents\, her experiences with devotees worldwide and he
 r commission by Swami Kriyananda to teach and share the principles of Self
 -Realization with all truth seekers.\n\nThis event is FREE and open to all
 .  It will be in person and livestreamed to Youtube.com/AnandaPortland\n\
 n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/07/Ashan-Nayaswami-Headshot-300-x-400-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,Guest Speakers,Service &amp; Satsangs
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaver
 ton\, OR\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Portlan
 d Temple:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
