DTSTAMP:20240823T200610Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/self-realization-the-fearless-heart-
 a-workshop-with-asha-nayaswami/
SUMMARY:Self-Realization: The Fearless Heart\; a workshop with Asha Nayaswa
 mi
DESCRIPTION:"Make us fearless by letting us know that we are waking and dre
 aming in Thee\, and that we are Thy all-protected\, ever-happy Self."\n\nF
 rom a poem by Paramhansa Yogananda\, "Make Us Thyself" \n\n&nbsp\;\n\nSel
 f-Realization is a path to fearlessness and freedom. There appears to be c
 ountless reasons to be afraid in this world of chaos and confusion. How ca
 n we possibly have a fearless heart while living on this planet?\n\nJoin u
 s today for this class with Asha Nayaswami - disciple\, teacher\, counselo
 r\, world traveler\, author\, and joyful ambassador of Self-realization. S
 he was trained by Swami Kriyananda\, a direct disciple of Paramhansa Yogan
 anda who is known world-wide for his wisdom and countless accomplishments 
 as a spiritual guide and leader.\n\nAsha is the author of "Swami Kriyanand
 a: Lightbearer" and several other spiritual works. She has shared the teac
 hings of Self-realization around the globe and is known for her clarity an
 d depth in understanding and expressing the timeless truths in scripture a
 nd the ancient philosophy of yoga and the art and science of Kriya yoga as
  taught by her guru\, Paramhansa Yogananda.\n\nYou can find out more about
  Asha on her website\, ashajoy.org and her Youtube channel.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/07/Ashan-Nayaswami-Headshot-300-x-400-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,Guest Speakers,workshop
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
