URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/womens-retreat-joy-of-the-heart/
SUMMARY:Women's Retreat: Joy of the Heart
DESCRIPTION:\n\nGather with Ananda sisters of the PNW for a weekend of reju
 venation and spiritual friendship at Hanger Farm in Ethel Washington - hal
 fway between Seattle and Portland.\n\nLed by Gita and Vahini\, this specia
 l weekend will feature daily sadhana\, Ananda yoga\, chanting\, cooking to
 gether\, a very special morning doing meditation and experiential learning
  with horses nearby\, and time for relaxation at a private homestead nestl
 ed on 30 acres.\n\nThe homestead is modest\, but comfortable for up to 12 
 guests. For those who want more privacy\, you're welcome to tent outside. 
 A recently cut hayfield next to the homestead will be a place for yoga and
  evening star gazing.\n\nWhen: 3pm on Saturday\, August 31 to 10am on Mond
 ay\, September 2nd\n\nWhere:  Hanger Farm at Ethel\, WA \n\nCost:  All-in
 clusive $250 per person for up to 12 women. Includes two night shared acco
 mmodations\, as well as meals from dinner on Saturday through breakfast on
  Monday. Not included: travel to/from the retreat.\n\n     
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/05/ae5a30fe-e818-4612-8bb3-20fc898d31ad.webp
CATEGORIES:Retreat
END:VEVENT
