 e summer.\n\nThese are free events and open to all. Bring a blanket to sit
  on if you like to sit on the grass\, and enjoy the devotion.\n\nBe mindfu
 l of the weather and the change in temperature as the sun goes down.\n\nMo
 st chants are in English and words are provided. We have brief periods of 
