 sing-and-revitalizing-diet/
SUMMARY:Paramhansa Yogananda’s Nine-Day Cleansing and Revitalizing Diet
DESCRIPTION:Yogananda's 9-Day Cleansing &amp\; Revitalizing Diet\n\nwith Ba
 dri &amp\; Gita -- FREE (donations to support Ananda Portland gratefully a
 ccepted)\nJoin us for Paramhansa Yogananda's 9-Day Cleansing &amp\; Revita
 lizing Diet with Badri and Gita at Ananda Portland from September 9-17! Th
 is transformative experience includes 2-3 Zoom satsangs\, a supportive Wha
 tsApp group\, and ongoing inspiration and guidance. Rejuvenate your body a
 nd spirit with the teachings and practices of yoga for Self-realization\, 
 radiant health and well-being. \n\nDon't miss this opportunity to cleanse 
 body\, mind and spirit with friends near and far--stay tuned for more reso
 urces and information coming soon!
