URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/living-wisdom-in-the-early-years-beg
 ins/
SUMMARY:Living Wisdom in the Early Years Begins
DESCRIPTION:Living Wisdom in the Early Years and Supplemental Kindergarten 
 2024-25\n\nThis program\, based on the Education for Life principles\, is 
 for ages 3 - 7.  Classes meet on Tuesdays and Thursdays @ 9 - 12:30.\n\nF
 all term begins September 17th.  Fall quarter is 11 weeks\n\nPreschool &a
 mp\; Kindergarten schedule for Fall 2024\n\nEach quarter we take a field t
 rip \n\nSeptember 17 &amp\; 19  First week of school\n\nSeptember 24 &am
 p\; 26\n\nOctober 1 &amp\; 3 \n\nOctober 8 &amp\; 10 No School \n\nOctob
 er 15 &amp\; 17 \n\nOctober 22 &amp\; 24\n\nOctober 29 &amp\; 31 Hallowee
 n Celebration\n\nNovember 5 &amp\; 7\n\nNovember 12 &amp\; 14\n\nNovember 
 19 &amp\; 21 Stone Soup Celebration\n\nNovember 26 &amp\; 28 Thanksgiving 
 week closed- no school\n\nDecember 3 &amp\; 5 Festivals of Light\n\nDecemb
 er 10 &amp\; 12 Festivals of Light and last week of Fall quarter \n\nWint
 er Break December 13th- January 1st\nTuition Preschool &amp\; Kindergarten
 \n(2 days a week\, 9:00-12:30) \n\n$825 for 11 weeks for Fall program + $
 50 Materials fee\n\n$750 for 10 weeks for Winter Program + $50 Materials f
 ee\n\n$750 for 10 weeks for Spring Program + $50 Materials fee\n\nOffered 
 in Fall\, Winter and Spring\n\nPlease contact Melissa Heart for more infor
 mation and a tour at (503) 671-9112\n\nefl@anandaportland.org\n\n\n\n&nbsp
 \;\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/05/Living-Wisdom-in-the-Early-Years-Fall-2024-1.jpeg
