URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/restorative-yoga-with-janice/
SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox Retreat\; Restorative Yoga for Inner Communion
DESCRIPTION:The Autumn Equinox is a time for balance\, reflection and resto
 ration.  Take this time to go within\, be still\, and heal. Our evening w
 ill include music for inner communion and an extended Deep Relaxation with
  live harp accompaniment.\n\n \nRestorative Yoga is a calm and gentle sty
 le of yoga that utilizes props (blankets\, bolsters\, blocks\, and straps)
 . Each pose is held for 5-10 minutes to help you relax\, still your mind\,
  release layers of physical tension\, and increase overall wellness.\nInst
 ructor: Janice Fairlee\nCertified Restorative Ananda Yoga\nAvid Chanter &a
 mp\; Harp Player\n*Due to prop availability\, we will limit the participan
 ts to 10 people.\nRegister below. Sliding scale fee $20 - $30
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 22/06/thumbnail_JM-restorative.jpg
