SUMMARY:Kriya Initiation Ceremony with Devalila
DESCRIPTION:For Ananda Kriyabans and Kriya Initiates Only\n\nKriyacharyas:
   Devalila Veenhof and Surendra Conti\n\nSchedule:\n\n4 - 5 PM Meditation
 \n\n5 PM: Front doors are locked\n\n5 - 7 PM: Ceremony\n\nPlease bring a f
 lower\, fruit and offering for the initiation. Wear white\, if possible.\n
 \nIf you have questions\, please call 503-626-3403 or email portland@anand
 aportland.org\n\nPreregistration is required to attend. Please contact por
 tland@anandaportland.org\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nA kriya review for kriyabans will b
 e offered on Sunday 9/29 at 8:30 AM. No registration required. Come to the
  temple and meet in the Inspiration classroom.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nDevalila Veen
 hof is a kriyacharya and director of the Ananda Worldwide Kriya ministry. 
 Shevlives in Ananda Village in California. We are pleased to have her in P
 ortland for this initiation.\n\n\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp
 \;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nSurendra Conti is a Kriyacharya and
  lightbearer who lives and serves in the Ananda Portland Sangha.\n\n\n\n&n
 bsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\
 n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
