SUMMARY:Harvest Day at the Community
DESCRIPTION:Harvest Day is our fall seva day and all are encouraged to take
  part!\n\nThis year we will be harvesting and juicing apples from our abun
 dant orchard. We will also be working in the greenspace\, weeding\, prunin
 g\, and preparing for future projects. All skill levels are welcome.\n\n8:
 30 AM - get going with coffee and treats\n\n9 AM - opening circle and job 
 assignments\n\n12:30 ish - meditation\n\n1 PM - Lunch\n\nTimes are approxi
 mate and you are welcome to come anytime.\n\n*Supplies are provided\, but 
 you may want to bring your own work gloves. \n\nSign up here:\n\nhttps://
 docs.google.com/forms/d/1IxFbcLd8-wyHS9x9FTRI1FWX9Mc7NDKQFtF5xoc0JYU/edit
