SUMMARY:Pilgrimage to the Shrines of Paramhansa Yogananda
DESCRIPTION:ANANDA WASHINGTON &amp\; ANANDA PORTLAND\n\nPilgrimage to the S
 hrines of Paramhansa Yogananda\nOctober 7 – 11\, 2024\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou
  are invited to join Nayaswami Hriman and Badri Matlock on this inspiring 
 spiritual adventure!  We will visit and meditate at the shrines of Paramh
 ansa Yogananda throughout Southern California. The pilgrimage will take pl
 ace from October 7 to 11\, 2024.\nDetails and registration now available 
 with Ananda Washington.
