DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20241019T150000
DTSTAMP:20241015T182956Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/transformative-arts-with-bharati/
SUMMARY:Transformative Arts with Bharati
DESCRIPTION:Unleash Your Creative Spirit!\nA Transformative Arts Experience
  \nJoin me in an experience to awaken your imagination\, using a variety 
 of media to explore what is inside you\, just waiting to emerge.\nWe'll si
 ng\, move\, and play with paper\, water\, and tempera.\n\nNo artistic skil
 ls or experience necessary\n\nBharati Busch is a long time disciple of Yog
 ananda and has served as a minister\, teacher\, lightbearer and counselor 
 at Ananda Portland for decades. A beloved EFL teacher at our Living Wisdom
  School for many years\, Bharati is fun\, full of light and joyful creativ
 ity.\n\nRecently\, Bharati has studied with artist Dana Anderson in Assisi
 \, Italy.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/09/Arts.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,workshop
LOCATION:Ananda Community\, 7020 SW Vermont Court\, Portland\, Oregon\, 972
 23\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=7020 SW Vermont Court\, Por
 tland\, Oregon\, 97223\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda C
 ommunity:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
