URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/kirtan-at-the-temple-8/
SUMMARY:Kirtan at the Temple
DESCRIPTION:Our monthly kirtans take place in the temple during the fall an
 d winter.\n\nThese are free events and open to all.   No experience is n
 ecessary\, just a desire to sing to God. Most chants are by Swami Kriyanan
 da and Paramhansa Yogananda and are sung in English. Words are provided.\n
 \nWe have brief periods of meditation between chants and at the end of the
  evening.\n\nWe hope to see you there!
