URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/kirtan-at-the-temple-7/
SUMMARY:Kirtan at the Temple with Sagar
DESCRIPTION:Tonight's kirtan will welcome Nayaswami Sagar from Ananda Villa
 ge.  Sagar will be here for the weekend and will give a class on Saturday
  and will speak at Sunday Service.\n\nPlease come an join us for this devo
 tional kirtan with Sagar.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nOur monthly kirtans take place in 
 the temple during the fall and winter.\n\nThese are free events and open t
 o all.   No experience is necessary\, just a desire to sing to God. Most
  chants are by Swami Kriyananda and Paramhansa Yogananda and are sung in E
 nglish. Words are provided.\n\nWe have brief periods of meditation between
  chants and at the end of the evening.\n\nWe hope to see you there!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 23/11/templekirtan1023-scaled.jpg
