DTSTAMP:20241026T001307Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/how-to-tune-into-the-divine-mother-a
 spect-of-god-with-nayaswami-sagar/
SUMMARY:How to Tune into the Divine Mother Aspect of God with Nayaswami Sag
 ar
DESCRIPTION:\n\nNayaswami Sagar resides in the Ananda Monastery located at 
 Ananda Village in Northern California. Born into a family of kriya-yogis\,
  Sagar read Paramhansa Yogananda's Autobiography of a Yogi at a young age\
 , an influence that culminated in his decision to serve Yogananda's missio
 n through Ananda.\n\nSagar led Ananda's work in Mumbai for about five year
 s and has served Ananda's work in India and the US as a teacher and counse
 lor to students and as a meditation and stress-relief workshop facilitator
  for corporates.\n\nPrior to commencing his life of service at Ananda\, Sa
 gar was a graduate student with full scholarship at Boston University and 
 holds advanced degrees in Engineering.\n\n\nSagar currently serves in Anan
 da's Online Ministry. He is one of the principal instructors for the Anand
 a Course in Meditation and has helped create several online offerings suc
 h as the full-length courses The Yoga Teachings of Jesus\, Karma and Rei
 ncarnation and the webinars The Anatomy of the Astral Body\, Losing the
  Fear of Death Through the Science of Yoga\, and How to Stand Unshaken am
 idst Life’s Challenges. You can read some of his articles here.\n\n****
 ************************************\n\nThis morning's class will be a dee
 p look into the Divine Mother aspect of God.\n\n\n\nSwami Kriyananda said\
 , "In our relationship with God\, it’s a lot easier to love God in human
  terms\, and especially to love God as that which is nearest and dearest 
 — the Mother. To most human beings this mother aspect is the most pre
 cious because you feel with the Divine Mother that\, no matter what you d
 o\, She still loves you. She won’t judge you. No matter who you are\, Sh
 e’s your friend. She’s on your side and will always forgive you."\n\nW
 e will share inspiring stories\, music\, techniques and practices that dra
 w the experience of the Divine Mother into our consciousness.\n\nJoin us f
 or this morning of opening our hearts to Divine Mother.\n\n\nIn-person and
  Live-stream tickets available below.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 21/12/Mother2-1-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,Guest Speakers,Meditation,music,workshop
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaver
 ton\, OR\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Portlan
 d Temple:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
