DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20241206T193000
DTSTAMP:20241204T203848Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/kirtan-at-the-temple-9/
SUMMARY:Christmas Kirtan at the Temple
DESCRIPTION:Our monthly kirtans take place in the temple during the fall an
 d winter.\n\n\n\nTonight\, our kirtan will carry the theme of Christmas as
  we move into the holy season.\n\nThese are free events and open to all. 
   No experience is necessary\, just a desire to sing to God. Most chants 
 are by Swami Kriyananda and Paramhansa Yogananda and are sung in English. 
 Words are provided.\n\nWe have brief periods of meditation between chants 
 and at the end of the evening.\n\nWe hope to see you there!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 23/11/templekirtan1023-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Devotional Event,Kirtan/Chanting,music
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaver
 ton\, OR\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Portlan
 d Temple:geo:0,0
