SUMMARY:Christmas Harp Magic
DESCRIPTION:\n\nJoin us for an evening of Christmas music that will soothe 
 your heart and make your soul sing.  Take time out of the busy holiday se
 ason for an inward experience of harp music and meditation.  Soothing har
 p instrumentals with sing-along Christmas carols and devotional chants wil
 l be interspersed with periods of meditation.\n\nLive harp music provided 
 by Janice Fairlee\, devotee musician.\n\nWe welcome you to experience this
  FREE musical evening with us. Donations are appreciated.\n\n&nbsp\;
