URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/martin-luther-king-commemoration-eve
 nt/
SUMMARY:Martin Luther King Memorial Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this evening of tribute to Dr. Martin Luther King J
 r. and the spirit of ahimsa he lived.  His saintly influence will be felt
  for generations to come.\n\nWe look forward to having you with us as we r
 emember this great soul. There will be meditation\, readings\, choir songs
 \, audience sing-alongs\, recorded excerpts from celebrated MLK speeches\,
  and old news footage of some of his famous marches.\n\nThis event will be
  FREE. Donations are always welcome.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 23/11/mlk.620.portrait.jpg
CATEGORIES:Community,music,Service &amp; Satsangs
LOCATION:Ananda Temple and Teaching Center\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton
 \, OR\, 97005\, United States
