URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/kirtan-in-the-temple-2/
SUMMARY:"Deeper Dive" Kirtan in the Temple
DESCRIPTION:Our kirtan tonight will be focused on Paramhansa Yogananda's Co
 smic Chants. These chants will take you closer to Yogananda and his livin
 g presence. Come with an open heart and invite Yogananda in with each chan
 t.\n\n**************************************************\n\nKirtan is a sh
 ared time of devotional chanting\, with short periods of meditation. Chant
 ing is a spiritual practice that opens the heart and allows for an experie
 nce of deep inner stillness and connection with the divine presence within
 .\n\nNo experience necessary!  We will share the words to the chants\, wh
 ich are usually in English and occasionally in Sanskrit. Our musicians use
  harmoniums\, guitars and a harp.\n\nPlease come and join us for our month
 ly kirtans. All are welcome.\n\nUpcoming dates: March 14\n\nThis is a free
  event.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/12/master_holding_an_esraj_and_smiling___darker__low_res-420x420-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Kirtan/Chanting
LOCATION:Ananda Temple in Beaverton\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, O
 regon\, 97005\, United States
