 verton\, Oregon\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda 
 Temple in Beaverton:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3002040@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20250208T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20250208T153000
DTSTAMP:20250109T191807Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/coming-to-terms-with-endless/
SUMMARY:Are You Ready for Endless?
DESCRIPTION:We die and go on... forever! Immortality can seem as scary as d
 eath. Join us as we explore how to be at ease and at peace with both.\n\nW
 hat are we afraid of? Topping the list for most of us is what comes after 
 this life and the dying required to get there. In this workshop we will lo
 ok deeply at how to dispel our worries about the “final exam” that awa
 its us and our loved ones\, leading us to a clear view of how to live fear
 lessly\, joyfully and fully… now and forever! \n\nWe will look at death
  from personal and metaphysical points of view\, discuss how to cope most 
 effectively with difficult loss and grief\, contemplate the nature of high
 er dimensions ahead\, and conduct an Astral Ascension for ourselves as the
  ascendants\, freed of earthly attachments.\n\n“You see bodies falling\,
 ” said Lord Krishna\, “I see souls rising.”\n\n*********************
 ***********************************************\n\nThis workshop will be f
 rom 9 am - 3:30 pm\, with a lunch break\n\nLunch will be on your own. You 
 can choose to bring something and eat in the temple or venture to one of t
 he many places nearby.\n\nWe look forward to sharing the day with you and 
 exploring this universal topic that is deeply personal and yet impersonal 
 for all souls.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nTaught by Surendra Conti\n\nSurendra has serv
 ed Ananda's work in several communities and centers in the U.S. and India 
 for nearly 30 years. He is a Lightbearer\, an Ananda life member\, and the
  former co-spiritual director of Ananda Pune and Ananda Portland. A teache
 r of many classes\, he is also the author of five books\, which are featur
 ed on his website: letmerememberthis.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 20/03/garden-cupola-crystal-hermitage-2018-aa-720x960-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Classes,workshop
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaver
 ton\, OR\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Portlan
 d Temple:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
