SUMMARY:Ananda Yoga for Joy
DESCRIPTION:Yoga for Joy is a beginners class dedicated to finding your cen
 ter and feeling the freedom within. It offers a deep and mindful practice
  dedicated to the flow of energy or prana in the body. The poses aid the p
 rocess of releasing trapped energy coupled with affirmations to keep the m
 ind uplifted\, helping you restore a calm and open heart and an uplifted c
 onsciousness. 
