SUMMARY:Spiritual Resilience: Strength in Community
DESCRIPTION:Spiritual Resilience: Strength in Community\n\n\n\nA zoom satsa
 ng with Badri &amp\; Gita coming together in the face of uncertain and tro
 ubling times for our country\, government and world. Together we will:\n\n
  	Review and practice Paramhansa Yogananda's powerful techniques to streng
 then spiritual power and resilience in troubling times\n 	Share the predic
 tions and teachings of Yogananda and Swami Kriyananda relevant to this top
 ic\n 	Briefly open discussion to address the challenges and uncertainties 
 we are facing\n 	Pray for individual and global divine peace and harmony\n
 \nWe have been given the tools\, techniques and divine grace for exactly t
 he circumstances we are facing at this time--as individuals\, as a nation 
 and world people--let us stand with courage\, joy and love to be channels 
 for Divine Light now and always.\n\nJoin us via Zoom\, Thur. Feb. 20\, 7-8
 pm: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/82244621931\n\n
END:VEVENT
