DESCRIPTION:This annual Ananda Portland men's retreat is a wonderful opport
 unity for devotees of Paramhansa Yogananda to spend time together in medit
 ation\, relaxation\, devotion and satsang.\n\n\n\nThe retreat will take pl
 ace in the greater Portland area and may include cooking together\, hiking
 \, music and more. Further details about the location will be coming soon.
 \n\nThis men's retreat will be led by Badri Matlock\, c0-spiritual directo
 r of Ananda Portland.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
