 larity\, guiding us toward our highest path.\n \nWe'll chant many sanskri
 t chants to Shiva\, Ganesha\, and Divine Mother.  It will be an evening o
 f devotional fun!\n\nFREE  All are welcome.  Address:  7020 SW Vermont 
 Court
