 re locked\n\n5 - 7 PM: Ceremony\n\nPlease bring a flower\, fruit and offer
 ing for the initiation. Wear white\, if possible.\n\nIf you have questions
 \, please call 503-626-3403 or email portland@anandaportland.org\n\nPrereg
 istration is required to attend. Please contact portland@anandaportland.or
 g\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nA kriya review for kriyabans will be offered on Sunday at 
 8:30 AM. No registration required. Come to the temple and meet in the Insp
 iration classroom.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nSurendra Conti is a Kriyacharya and light
