 outh-club-community-benefit-dinner/
SUMMARY:Los Angeles Disaster Relief ~ Ananda Youth Club Community Benefit D
 inner
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for a special benefit dinner supporting those most in
  need following the devastating wildfires in Los Angeles\, CA. Our Ananda 
 youth Service Adventure Club is inspired to raise funds and energy to supp
 ort the California Community Fund's wildfire relief efforts with an extrao
 rdinary meal together at our Ananda Community. The minimum donation to att
 end is $25 per person and 100% of all revenue will go to California Commun
 ity Foundation's special Wildfire Relief Fund to help those most in need w
 ith food\, shelter\, cash and other essentials.\nMenu: Pasta Cacio e Pepe\
 , Spring Salad\, Garlic Ciabatta\, Roasted Vegetable Medley\, Delectable D
 essert Surprise \n&nbsp\;\nGF &amp\; Vegan Options Available - Note prefer
 ences upon registration\n   \n&nbsp\;\n&nbsp\;\n&nbsp\;\n&nbsp\;\n    
     https://www.pledge.to/ccfwildfirerelieffund\n&nbsp\;\nCan't attend b
 ut still wish to support our event? Donate here and be sure to include a c
 lear memo such as "LA Wildfire Relief Fund"\n&nbsp\;\n&nbsp\;\n[caption id
 ="attachment_16560162" align="aligncenter" width="350"] Ananda youth Servi
 ce Adventure Club[/caption]\n\n\n\n\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 25/01/Benefit-Dinner-1.jpg
