SUMMARY:Mahasamadhi Celebration
DESCRIPTION:This evening's celebration marks the Mahasamadhi\, or conscious
  exit from the body\, of Paramhansa Yogananda and Swami Sri Yukteswar.\n\n
 When a master leaves the physical world\, he leaves a spiritual imprint th
 at lasts forever and blesses all souls. These are holy occasions\; providi
 ng deep opportunities for those who tune into the power of the great souls
  who come to guide us to our divine home.\n\nWe will chant and meditate to
 gether\, share stories and music and offer our devotion.  All are welcome
 .\n\nFREE\, with an opportunity to make a donation if you feel to.\n\n&nbs
 p\;\n\n&nbsp\;
