SUMMARY:Kirtan in the Temple
DESCRIPTION:Kirtan is a shared time of devotional chanting\, with short per
 iods of meditation. Chanting is a spiritual practice that opens the heart 
 and allows for an experience of deep inner stillness and connection with t
 he divine presence within.\n\nNo experience necessary!  We will share the
  words to the chants\, which are usually in English and occasionally in Sa
 nskrit. Our musicians use harmoniums\, guitars and a harp.\n\nPlease come 
 and join us for our monthly kirtans. All are welcome.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nThis i
 s a free event.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 23/11/templekirtan1023-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Kirtan/Chanting
END:VEVENT
