SUMMARY:Ananda Global Outreach Satsang
DESCRIPTION:\n🌍 Ananda’s Global Outreach: A Special Fundraising Event\
 nJoin us for an inspiring Satsang as the AnandaFundraising Team visits our
  community to share how Ananda’s light is expanding around the world!\nA
 nanda’s mission continues to touch hearts globally\, spreading Yogananda
 ’s teachings of inner peace\, joy\, and divine connection. This special 
 gathering will highlight:\n✨ The latest projects and initiatives from An
 anda worldwide✨ How our community is making a difference✨ Ways we can 
 support this sacred work together\nThis is an opportunity to feel deeply c
 onnected to Ananda’s greater mission and discover how we can each play a
  part in its growth.\nLet’s come together in support\, inspiration\, and
  unity! Light refreshments will be served.\nSpend more time with our visit
 ors by coming to the LJC at the Ananda Community for breakfast on Saturday
  9:30am. \n\n&nbsp\;
