 ayaswami-parvati/
SUMMARY:Say YES to Life!  With Nayaswami Pranaba and Nayaswami Parvati
DESCRIPTION:\n\nThis weekend we have the joy of welcoming guests from Anand
 a Village\, Nayaswami Pranaba and Nayaswami Parvati. Pranaba and Parvati a
 re former Ananda Portland leaders and have spent decades practicing the te
 achings of Paramhansa Yogananda.\n\nFounding members of Ananda\, who were 
 trained by Swami Kriyananda\, Pranaba and Parvati have a wealth of experie
 nce to share. They helped to start the centers in Seattle\, Palo Alto\, Da
 llas\, Assisi\, and Portland.\n\nNayaswami Parvati is the author of "Say Y
 es to Life! Spiritual Adventure and Discipleship in the Building of Ananda
 ."\n\nPranaba will be speaking on spiritual adventure and how Yogananda's 
 timeless teachings\, as well as the example of Swami Kriyananda\, show us 
 how to live in these challenging times of change and uncertainty.
