DESCRIPTION:This evening we will have an informal satsang with Nayaswami Pr
 anaba and Nayaswami Parvati. They will talk about Parvati's book\, "Say Ye
 s to Life!" and their years with Swami Kriyananda as founding members of A
 nanda.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nParvati and Pranaba spent years in Portland and t
 hey love the opportunity to be back here. They are looking forward to bein
 g with old friends and making new friends in Portland.\n\nThis is a FREE e
 vent.
