SUMMARY:Nayaswami Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi Visit Portland
DESCRIPTION:Nayaswami Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi are lifelong devotees of P
 aramhansa Yogananda and serve as spiritual directors of Ananda Worldwide. 
 We are thrilled to welcome them back to Portland for a visit.\n\n\n\n&nbsp
 \;\n\nBelow is an overview of scheduled events.\n\nFri April 11\, 7pm\, Ne
 w Renaissance Bookshop Event Center \n\nHope For A Better World: Spiritual
  Community\, featuring music\, inspiration\, questions &amp\; answers with
  Jyotish &amp\; Devi.   FREE\n\nSat April 12\, 10am-12pm\, The Grotto \
 n\n Divine Mother Tea\, a concert &amp\; fundraiser for Ananda Portland wi
 th Jyotish &amp\; Devi\n\nSeating is limited. $150 donation/person ($250 p
 er couple) to attend - register HERE.\n\nSat April 12\, 6pm\, Ananda Portl
 and Temple\n\nHope For A Better World: The Self-realization Solution featu
 ring music\, inspiration\, questions &amp\; answers with Jyotish &amp\; De
 vi\, snacks and refreshments to follow\n\nSun. April 13\, 9am\, Ananda Por
 tland Temple\n\n9am Fire &amp\; Purification Ceremonies\, 10am Sunday Serv
 ice with Jyotish and Devi\, satsang and refreshments to follow\n\nWe hope 
 you can join us for this special weekend of events!\n\nThis special weeken
 d is made possible in part by the Ananda Janaka Foundation.\n\nThe Ananda 
 Janaka Foundation is a 501 (c) (3)\, non-profit\, religious foundation est
 ablished to support the future of Ananda through estate gift planning.\n\n
 &nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n
