URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/hope-for-a-better-world-spiritual-co
 mmunity/
SUMMARY:Spiritual Community: Hope for a Better World
DESCRIPTION:Ananda Portland presents a special evening with Nayaswami Jyot
 ish and Nayaswami Devi\, visiting spiritual directors of Ananda Sangha Wor
 ldwide and United Nations Global Peace Ambassadors. For over fifty years\,
  Jyotish and Devi have been instrumental in the creation\, leadership and 
 support of spiritual communities all over the world.\n\nJoin us for a spec
 ial evening of music\, inspiration and sharing with time for questions and
  answers. Together we can create a more peaceful world starting with our o
 wn hearts and minds\, and expanding to our communities and the world aroun
 d us.\n\nAll are welcome to this FREE event at New Renaissance Bookshop Ev
 ent Center. \n\n&nbsp\;\n\nOther events to enjoy during Jyotish and Devi'
 s Portland visit: \n\nSaturday\, April 12 @ 10 AM:  Divine Mother Concer
 t and Tea at The Grotto\nThis is a special fundraiser event at the beautif
 ul sanctuary in NE Portland.\n\n\nSaturday\, April 12 @ 6 PM: Hope for a B
 etter World: The Self-Realization Solution\nMusic\, inspiration\, question
 s and answers with Jyotish and Devi\, snacks and refreshments to follow. 
   Held at the Ananda Portland Temple in Beaverton.  FREE\n\nSunday\, Apr
 il 13 @ 9 AM:  Fire and Purification Ceremonies and Sunday Service with J
 yotish and Devi at the Ananda Portland Temple.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nThis special 
 weekend is made possible in part with the support of the Ananda Janaka Fou
 ndation. \n\nThe Ananda Janaka Foundation is a 501 (c) (3)\, non-profit\,
  religious foundation established to support the future of Ananda through 
 estate gift planning.\n\n&nbsp\;
