SUMMARY:Hope for a Better World: The Self-Realization Solution
DESCRIPTION:🌍  Hope for a Better World: The Self-Realization Solution 
 🌍\nJoin us for a transformative evening of wisdom and inspiration with 
 renowned spiritual leaders Nayaswami Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi at the Ana
 nda Temple in Beaverton.\n🎟 Free Event – All Are Welcome!\nIn these t
 imes of uncertainty\, how can we create a better world—both within ourse
 lves and in the world around us? Jyotish and Devi\, spiritual directors of
  Ananda Worldwide and lifelong disciples of Paramhansa Yogananda\, will sh
 are profound insights on the role of Self-Realization in bringing hope\, h
 armony\, and positive change to our lives and communities.\n✨ Expect an 
 evening filled with uplifting wisdom\, practical spiritual tools\, and hea
 rt-opening inspiration. Whether you seek inner peace\, clarity\, or a deep
 er sense of purpose\, this event offers guidance to help navigate life wit
 h strength\, joy\, and divine connection.\nSeats are limited—arrive earl
 y to reserve your spot!\n📢 Spread the word and invite a friend!\n\nThes
 e special weekend events are made possible in part by the support of the A
 nanda Janaka Foundation. \nThe Ananda Janaka Foundation is a 501 (c) (3)\
 , non-profit\, religious foundation established to support the future of A
 nanda through estate gift planning.
