SUMMARY:Drop-in Harp Meditation with Janice
DESCRIPTION:Join Janice in meditation on Wednesday evenings at our beautifu
 l temple.\n\nYou could attend the drop-in yoga class with Melissa  - 6:30
  PM\, then stay for meditation with harp music.\n\nJanice will open the me
 ditation with the harp and then there will be a period of silent meditatio
 n with a music break at 7:45 PM.\n\nThe front doors will lock at 7:15\, bu
 t you can leave anytime.\n\nTake a mid-week break to go within and be in s
 acred space to renew and uplift your heart.\n\nFree - no registration requ
 ired. 
