 , moksha\, on this date in 2013.\n\nToday we celebrate his freedom in God 
 and we remember his divine friendship and his discipleship.\n\nWe will hav
 e a meditation in the Community chapel with chanting and readings\, follow
 ed by silent meditation.\n\nAll are welcome.\n\n&nbsp\;
