URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/rajarsi-seva-day-at-community/
SUMMARY:Rajarshi Seva Day at Community
DESCRIPTION:Rajarshi Day is named for Rajarshi Janakananda\, the great disc
 iple of Yogananda. He worked and attained material success in the world\, 
 as well as spiritual success and freedom by attunement with his guru.\n\nD
 uring Rajarshi Day we work together to beautify and uplift our Spiritual C
 ommunity\, sharing divine friendship\, inspiration\, laughter and attuneme
 nt to our guru\, Paramhansa Yogananda.\n\nAll are welcome to join in the d
 ay. We will be serving lunch after our labors. All levels of skills are we
 lcome. Most work will be done outside\, rain or shine.\n\nSchedule:  8:30
  AM -  coffee and morning treats\n\n8:45 AM - Opening circle and job assi
 gnments\n\n12:00 - clean up and finishing tasks\n\n12:30 - meditation\n\n1
 2:45 - vegetarian lunch on the patio\n\n1:30 - final clean up and goodbye\
 n\nContact Lknox108@gmail.com with any questions.  Please register below 
 to let us know you are coming.\n\nSign up here!\n\nAddress:  7020 SW Verm
 ont Court\, Portland\, Oregon 97223\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/03/SevaLoriHavvaMichelle-scaled.jpg
