URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/sri-yukteswar-birthday/
SUMMARY:Sri Yukteswar Birthday Celebration
DESCRIPTION:\n\nSwami Sri Yukteswar Giri was born on May 10\, 1855 in Seram
 pore\, India. Sri Yukteswar was the guru of Paramhansa Yogananda and autho
 r of "The Holy Science".\n\nTonight we celebrate his birth with chanting\,
  meditation\, sharing of stories and readings\, with a devotional flower c
 eremony. The great avatar of wisdom was the polestar in Yogananda's life\;
  their relationship of divine friendship and love an inspiration to us all
 .\n\nAll are welcome. This is a free event.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 19/04/Yukteswar-large-150x150.jpg
