URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/discipleship-series-2-2025-05-13/
SUMMARY:Discipleship Series
DESCRIPTION:\n\nDiscipleship Class Series   May 13\, 20\, 27 @  7 - 8:30
  PM\n\nJoin us for an 3-week series of inspirational satsang and meditatio
 n diving deep into the practices\, teachings and path of discipleship. Thi
 s series will be co-led by Badri and Lorna\, lifelong disciples of Paramha
 nsa Yogananda\, and open to all sincere spiritual seekers who have complet
 ed the Art &amp\; Science of Raja Yoga Course or comparable experience wit
 h our spiritual tradition.\n\nWeekly class format will include approximate
 ly 30 minutes of guided and silent meditation\, followed by inspirational 
 teaching and discussion on the path of discipleship. Classes will be held 
 at Ananda Portland temple &amp\; teaching center\, and at the Ananda Commu
 nity\, details TBA.\n\nThis 3-class series is offered for the nominal fee 
 of $30 which includes A Handbook on Discipleship. \n\n🕉️🕉️🕉
 ️Jai Guru 🕉️🕉️🕉️\n\n"Attunement is the essence of discip
 leship. The deeper the disciple’s attunement\, the more perfect an instr
 ument he becomes for the guru’s grace. Something I have come to understa
 nd over time is that it is the duty of every disciple to be a channel for 
 his guru’s grace. I have realized\, too\, that the flow of that grace de
 pends on an inner sense of the guru’s presence. The extent to which a pe
 rson can keep and share this sense of his guru’s living presence determi
 nes his own trueness to the role of discipleship."  -Swami Kriyananda
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/04/paramhansa-yogananda-16x20-color-1280x1600-650x813-1.jpg
LOCATION:Ananda Temple in Beaverton\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, O
 regon\, 97005\, United States
