SUMMARY:Swami Kriyananda Birthday Celebration
DESCRIPTION:\n\nJoin us for an inspiring celebration of this great soul's b
 irth\, sharing inspiration and divine music to attune to the bliss and lov
 e that took expression in Swamiji's life\, and continues to thrive in the 
 spirit of Ananda.\n\nWe will share in Swami's music and share birthday cak
 e after!
