SUMMARY:Kirtan at Community
DESCRIPTION:Join Janice &amp\; Mic for an informal kirtan in the Living Jo
 y Center Chapel. \n\nJanice plays harp and harmonium and Mic brings his t
 alents with percussion and guitar. Together they are a lively team and the
 y will carry us along in devotion and song.\n\n\n\nFREE  All are welcome.
   Address:  7020 SW Vermont Court\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n
END:VEVENT
