DESCRIPTION:Explore Spiritual Community – Open House &amp\; Pizza NightFr
 iday\, June 20th | 5:00–7:00 PM\n\nCurious about living in spiritual com
 munity? Come enjoy a relaxed summer evening at Ananda Portland! Meet resid
 ents\, tour the community\, ask questions\, and share in vegetarian pizza 
 and meaningful conversation. All are welcome—whether you're just explori
 ng or already feeling called to a more connected way of life.\n\n7020 SW V
 ermont Court\, Portland\, 97223\n\nPark in any marked parking space. Parki
 ng also available on Vermont Street\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n
