URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/yoga-fest-at-temple/
SUMMARY:Yoga Fest at Temple
DESCRIPTION:\nThe International Day of Yoga and the Summer Solstice fall on
  June 21st!\n\nThe Ananda Temple is hosting a Yoga Fest to celebrate. \n
 🗓 Friday\, June 21\, 10 AM - 12 PM📍 Ananda Temple\, Portland\nCelebr
 ate the light of the longest day with joy\, energy\, and inner connection 
 at our Summer Solstice Yoga Fest! Sample the full spectrum of what Ananda 
 has to offer in one inspiring morning:\n✨ Uplifting yoga classes🎶 Hea
 rt-opening kirtan🧘‍♀️ Guided meditation &amp\; relaxation\n*   
  Power of Mantra\n🍓 Healthy\, delicious snacks🌸 Community\, connecti
 on &amp\; inspiration\nWhether you're brand new to Ananda or a longtime fr
 iend\, this is a perfect time to come together\, try something new\, and c
 elebrate the spiritual light within.\nFree &amp\; open to all—bring a fr
 iend!\nAll who come\, will be entered into the drawing to win a free Vedic
  Astrology Reading with Fedor!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 25/02/Yoga-Fest.png
