 lage/
SUMMARY:Spiritual Renewal Week at Ananda Village
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n2025 Theme:\nThe Time for Knowing God Has Come\n\n\
 n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis year’s theme\, “The Time for Knowing God Has 
 Come\,” is a call to bring God into every part of our lives—not just 
 in moments of prayer\, but in how we work\, relate to others\, care for ou
 r bodies and minds\, and go about each day. It’s an invitation to live w
 ith greater awareness\, devotion\, and purpose—anchored in the presence 
 of God.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMorning Classes will be streamed every day and shown 
 in the Portland temple.\n\n*come to any or all of the classes as you are a
 ble\n\nMonday\, June 23\n\n10:30 am - 12 pm:  "The Search for God in Toda
 y's World"  class with Jyotish and Devi\n\n12:00 - 12:30: Meditation\n\nT
 uesday\, June 24\n\n10:30 am - 12 pm:  "Bringing God into Your Service" 
  class with Nayaswami Dharmadas\, Asha Nayaswami\, Tyagi Dhyan\n\n12:00 - 
 12:30: Meditation\n\nWednesday\, June 25\n\n10:30 am - 12 pm:  "Bringing 
 God into Our Relationships" class with Nayaswami Jaya\, Nayaswami Padma\, 
 Saiganesh\n\n12:00 - 12:30: Meditation\n\nThursday\, June 26\n\n10:30 am -
  12 pm:  Special Morning Program\n\n12:00 - 12:30: Meditation\n\nFriday\,
  June 27\n\n10:30 am - 12 pm:  "Bringing God into Our Sadhana"  class wi
 th Nayaswami Hriman\,  Nayaswami Maria\, Jitendra\n\n12:00 - 12:30: Medit
 ation\n\nSaturday\, June 28\n\n10:30 am - 12 pm:  "How I Deepen My Attune
 ment with My Guru" with Nayaswami Sagar\, Badri\, Erin\, Arya\n\n12:00 - 1
 2:30: Meditation\n\n************************************************\n\nCo
 me join us for the morning classes for FREE or pay an amount below\, or pa
 y on site at the temple.\n\nTake part in all the online events of SRW by r
 egistering with the Expanding Light HERE.
