DESCRIPTION:\nCelebrate Freedom &amp\; Community!Join us for a joyful after
 noon honoring both the birth of our country and the founding of Ananda!
 🎉 Potluck • 🎤 Talent Show • 🎲 GamesThursday\, July 4th | 4–
 7 PMAt the Ananda Community\nBring a dish to share\, your talents (or just
  your applause!)\, and your love of community fun. All are welcome!
