 odin/
SUMMARY:Senior Living Roadmap with Belinda Godin
DESCRIPTION:\n\nAll are warmly invited to an informative and supportive con
 versation about planning for the future. As we grow older and our needs ev
 olve\, it’s important to understand the options available for senior liv
 ing—and how to prepare thoughtfully for the choices ahead.  A warm and 
 friendly speaker\, Belinda Godin is an expert advisor in the field of seni
 or living. There will be time for questions and a free light lunch will be
  served following the presentation in thE LJC.\n\nContact Nayaswami Hanuma
 n Baughman with any questions.  phone: 503-941-8323\n\nRegister below. Th
 is is a free event.\n\n\n\nBelinda Godin\nSenior Advisor\, Educator\, Spea
 ker\nServices are Always Free\nAging Stages Senior Services\n971.488.3280\
 n\nBelinda@AgingStagesSeniorServices.com\nAgingStagesSeniorServices.com
