UID:4002694@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20250719T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20250719T120000
DTSTAMP:20250703T002806Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/life-force-how-to-heal-yourself-and-
 others-with-the-power-of-prana-with-shivani-lucki/
SUMMARY:Life Force: How to Heal Yourself and Others with the Power of Prana
  with Shivani Lucki
DESCRIPTION:(Online Workshop – Part 2: Mind)\n\n\n\n\nJoin Shivani for th
 is online workshop exploring the second book of her trilogy\, “Healing w
 ith Life Force: Mind.” We will study Paramhansa Yogananda’s teachings
  about using the mind’s power to heal body\, mind\, and soul.\n\nYou Are
  What You Think!\n\n“Develop the Healing Superpowers of Your Mind. All d
 isease has its roots in the mind. If the mind can produce ill health it ca
 n also produce good health.” –Paramhansa Yogananda\n\nWhat if the key 
 to your health\, happiness\, and success lies not in what you do\, but in 
 how you think? The way we think shapes everything—our appearance\, mood
 s\, opportunities\, and even our ability to navigate life’s challenges. 
 But until we take control of what Yogananda calls our “mental diet\,” 
 the doorway to healing Life Force will remain closed.\n\nIn this seminar\,
  based on the second volume of the Healing with Life Force trilogy\, Shiva
 ni will guide you through powerful practices to unlock and master your mi
 nd’s healing superpowers:\n\n 	\nThe Conscious Mind: Learn how to harnes
 s the powers of concentration\, willpower\, and visualizationto create the
  life you desire.\n\n 	\nThe Subconscious Mind: Explore Yogananda’s meth
 od for establishing healthy\, constructive habitsthat support lasting tran
 sformation.\n\n 	\nThe Superconscious Mind: Awaken your intuition—your a
 bility to receive divine guidance and life-changing insights.\n\n\nStep in
 to a new realm where your thoughts become allies\, and your mind a key to 
 a healthier\, more fulfilling life.\n\nNayaswami Shivani came to Ananda in
  June\, 1969. After serving for many years under the tutelage of\nHaanel C
 assidy in the gardens\, then as manager of Ananda Publications\, before be
 ing posted to Italy with her huband Arjuna in 1985 to help build the work 
 in Europe. She founded the Yogananda Academy of Europe and two of its scho
 ols—Ananda Raja Yoga Teacher Training\, and the Life Therapy School of S
 elf-Healing. Her first three books explore Yogananda’s teachings on heal
 ing—Healing with Life Force. She is currently completing her next book\,
  Know ThySelf: A Guide to the Practice of Introspection\, to be published 
 in early 2027.\n\nThis workshop is online only. Register here using the li
 nk below. You’ll receive the workshop Zoom link by email.\n\nRegister He
 re\n\n$30\nIT’S NOT TOO LATE to receive a recording of Shivani’s first
  workshop\, Life Force: How to heal yourself and others with the power of
  Prana. If you missed Shivani’s first workshop\, you can purchase a rec
 ording of it here: https://anandasacramento.org/product/healing-with-life
 -force-part1-recording/\nOne of the stories from Healing with Life Force\
 nFrom Panic Attack to Heart Attack\nOn the day before the hearing\, my cli
 ent called to say that he was on the way to the\nhospital with chest pain 
 and would be unable to appear in court. At the hospital\, he was\nadmitted
  with a heart attack.\nI was representing the client at his arraignment on
  charges of drug possession\, in the\ntribal court of a Native American re
 servation. Several days before the hearing\, he had\nwritten to say that h
 e did not want to appear\, because he was afraid of going to jail. I\ndid 
 my best to reassure him that we would find a reasonable solution. But his 
 anxiety\nonly increased\, and that evening he called and said that he was 
 considering suicide as\nan alternative to jail. I tried to calm him\, then
  I called social assistance.\nShortly thereafter\, he had the heart attack
 .\nIn court the next day\, I was able to negotiate a sentence without jail
  time. When he\nreceived the news\, his condition rapidly improved and he 
 was released from the\nhospital.\n\nThe situation turned out well for my c
 lient\, and was deeply instructive. I realized how\nour fears over a perce
 ived unwelcome future can lead to serious physical consequences.\nI also r
 ealized how anxious I habitually became before I had to appear in court\, 
 and\nhow the anxiety caused me to be nauseous and short-tempered with my h
 usband and\nchildren. It showed me how I had been sabotaging myself.\nThis
  was before I found my spiritual path and began to experience the miracles
  that\nmeditation and inner stillness could bring into my life. That long-
 ago courtroom\nexperience brought me a step closer to the path that would 
 offer me tools to meet my\nlife’s lessons with grace and acceptance\, an
 d to control my thoughts and emotions so\nthat they might bring only posit
 ive results. – Ryanna\, from a Native American Indian\nReservation.\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 25/06/Healing-with-Life-Force-Part-2-Mind-1-e1748816180105.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
