DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20250719T123000
DTSTAMP:20250915T012040Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/ananda-yoga-for-higher-awareness-202
 5-07-19/
SUMMARY:Ananda Yoga for Higher Awareness
DESCRIPTION:The practice of yoga postures (asanas) has many physical benefi
 ts. But did you know that yoga can also change your consciousness\, expand
  your awareness and help you in your spiritual journey?\n\nAnanda Yoga® i
 s uniquely designed to exercise your awareness while you move your body. A
 ffirmations accompany every asana and keep us focused on energy flow and k
 eep our consciousness uplifted.\n\nAnanda Yoga® prepares the body for sti
 llness. A brief meditation will follow the asanas so we have the opportuni
 ty to integrate the effect on the body\, mind\, and spirit.\n\nAnanda Yoga
 ® can be modified for every body. Modifications and chairs and props can 
 be used to accomplish the postures and achieve the same uplifting effect f
 or all students.\n\nPlease feel free to ask questions and talk to us about
  your needs.\n\nSenior Discount for over 65!\n\nYour First Ananda Yoga cla
 ss is always FREE!\n\nThis class will be taught by one of our Ananda Yoga 
 instructors: Badri Matlock\, Srimati Towbridge\, Melissa Heart
