URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/the-physics-of-unlimited-self-healin
 g/
SUMMARY:The Physics of Unlimited Self-Healing
DESCRIPTION:\nOnline program hosted by Ananda's own East West Bookshop in S
 eattle\, WA.\nThe Physics of Unlimited Self-Healing\n\n\nNo disease is inc
 urable. Extraordinarily rapid\, unlimited healing is possible. Modern phys
 ics’ breakthroughs in quantum physics and M-Theory—along with scientif
 ically verified phenomena such as the placebo effect and instant physiolog
 ical changes undergone by multiple-personality sufferers—support millenn
 ia old spiritual traditions that suggest that not only is extraordinary\, 
 unlimited healing possible\, but that we have innate soul powers—our emo
 tions\, personal beliefs\, and our ability to connect to Spirit—that dir
 ectly and powerfully determine our health and ability to self-heal. Read 
 more &amp\; register here.\n\nJoseph Selbie is the author of paradigm-cha
 nging The Physics of Miraculous Healing. A polymath\, Joseph is known for
  creating bridges of understanding between the modern evidenced-based disc
 overies of science and the timeless experience-based discoveries of the my
 stics. He is also the author of The Physics of God.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 25/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-152309.png
END:VEVENT
