URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/babaji-dedication-at-the-community/
SUMMARY:Babaji Day  Community Celebration 
DESCRIPTION:\n\nBabaji Day  Community Celebration \n\nJuly 26\, 2025 | 7-
 8:30pm | @ the Ananda Portland Community\n\nPrayer\, Chanting\, Meditation
 \, Inspiration\, Fire Ceremony\, Community Blessing\n\nThis special evenin
 g will invoke the supernal blessings of Mahavatar Babaji to celebrate our 
 30-year anniversary of the Ananda Portland community\, re-dedicate our liv
 es and our community to God and Gurus\, and launch the Yogananda Community
  Fund to secure the long-term ownership of our spiritual community.\n\n&nb
 sp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
