SUMMARY:Clothing Swap/ Ice Cream Social
DESCRIPTION: \nIt’s time to start preparing for our large\, upscale Churc
 h Community Yard Sale at the Temple on September 5th!\nPlease note: no clo
 thing or shoes will be sold at the yard sale.\nTo help everyone clear out 
 these items\, we’re hosting a Community Clothing and Shoe Swap at the An
 anda Community\, followed by an Ice Cream Social!\nBring your clothes and 
 shoes to the tables outside the community room (LJC) on Friday after 2 PM 
 or Saturday\, 10 - 4 PM. \nThis is a free event where you can leave items
  you no longer need and take anything you find that you like.\n🍦 Stay f
 or ice cream from 3:00–4:00 PM!\nLet’s share\, declutter\, and enjoy s
 ome sweet community time as we get ready for a successful yard sale!
