URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/blood-drive-at-the-temple-4/
SUMMARY:Blood Drive at the Temple
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\nHello all\,\n\nAnanda Church of Self Realization and th
 e American Red Cross are hosting an upcoming blood drive.\n\nPlease join o
 ur lifesaving mission and schedule an appointment today!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
 Drive Details:\nSite: Ananda Portland Temple\nAddress: 4855 SW Watson Av
 e\, Beaverton\, OR\, 97005\nRoom Name: American Red Cross Bloodmobile\nDa
 te: Wednesday\, January 22\, 2025\nTime: 10:00 AM - 03:00 PM\nBlood Prog
 ram Leader Name: Kent Baughman\nBlood Program Leader Phone Number:\nClick
  here to make an appointment\n\nDear Friends\,\n\nPlease go to redcrossblo
 od.org to register for our drive! Blessings\, Hanuman\n\nThe need for blo
 od is constant and only volunteer donors can fulfill that need for patient
 s in our community. Nationwide\, someone needs a unit of blood every 2 to 
 3 seconds and most of us will need blood in our lifetime.\n\nThank you for
  supporting the American Red Cross blood program!\n\nDownload the Red Cros
 s Blood Donor App on the App Store\, Google Play or text BLOODAPP to 90
 999. Schedule appointments\, view your blood type and results of your mini
 -physical\, and track your donations.\n\n\n\n
