URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/swami-kriyananda-birthday-event/
SUMMARY:Swami Kriyananda Discipleship Anniversary
DESCRIPTION:Swami Kriyananda never dreamed that he would travel across the 
 country to see Paramhansa Yogananda\, and with heartfelt devotion and desp
 eration\, say the words\, "I want to be your disciple."\n\nYogananda accep
 ted the young truth seeker and thus began a lifetime of discipleship and t
 he story behind the founding\, the success and the growth of Ananda as a w
 orldwide work based on Yogananda's teachings.\n\nWe celebrate Swami's disc
 ipleship every year\, with increasing gratitude and awe for a life of serv
 ice\, devotion and joy that has touched people across the globe.\n\nThis e
 vening will include music\, chanting\, meditation\, a flower offering\, a 
 group renewal of discipleship vows\, video of Swami Kriyananda and the joy
  of coming together as truth seekers.\n\nAll are welcome. Please join us.
