SUMMARY:Explore the Physics of God: Free Online Event
DESCRIPTION:\n\nSaturday\, September 20\, join Joseph Purushottoma Selbie f
 or a mind-opening online event that reveals the astonishing unity between 
 science and spirituality. Discover how breakthroughs in quantum physics an
 d multidimensional science validate the miraculous and empower your belief
 s.\n\nIn this free online event\, you'll:\n\n- Experience "Joy Breathing" 
 to reconnect with your life force and open a portal to inner peace and joy
 \n- Learn how revolutionary advances in physics illuminate profound spirit
 ual truths\n- Explore the unity of science and religion\, leading to a new
 found sense of personal power and wonder\n- Discover how deep changes in y
 our beliefs can transform every aspect of your life\n\nRegister now and aw
 aken to a greater reality where science validates the miraculous and wonde
 r infuses every part of your life: https://shiftnetwork.isrefer.com/go/epg
 BM/a27284/\n\n&nbsp\;
END:VEVENT
