URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/healingandwellnessindwaparayuga/
SUMMARY:Healing and Wellness in Dwapara Yuga\;  A new perspective on age ol
 d  “problems"
DESCRIPTION:Join Nayaswami Shanti\, MD and Lakshmi LaPine as we dive deep w
 ith a Dwapara or energy perspective on redefining  wellness and how we he
 al.\nTopics: Happiness\, Laughter and Attunement\, each with an emphasis o
 n energy … and fun!\nShanti has been a close friend to our Portland sang
 ha for years and she is looking forward to spending time with us again.  
 She will be sharing Spiritual Questions Answered on Saturday\, Sept 27 and
  speaking at Sunday service on September 28th.\n\nPlease register below an
 d choose a sliding scale amount.  You may also choose to pay at the templ
 e before the event. \n\nAbout Nayaswami Shanti:\nShanti is a lifelong dev
 otee and serves as one of the spiritual directors of Ananda Palo Alto. Her
  talks are rich with stories from her life as a physician and her many yea
 rs on the path. With her warmth and wisdom\, she is a much-loved counselor
  and teacher. She teaches\, counsels and still maintains a practice of med
 icine through her coaching practice of “Transformational Medicine.” Sh
 anti’s talks online.\n\nAbout Brahmacharini Lakshmi:\n\nLakshmi is an A
 nanda minister and one of the co-managers of Ananda Palo Alto. She also se
 rves as an English teacher and a mediator at a local high school\, dedicat
 ed to merging mindfulness and academics in a professional setting. She is 
 a thoughtful and delightfully engaging teacher at Ananda\, as well.
