SUMMARY:Spiritual Questions Answered with Nayaswami Shanti Rubenstone
DESCRIPTION:Shanti will answer any questions that relate to the spiritual p
 ath of Self-Realization and the teachings of Paramhansa Yogananda and his 
 direct disciple\, Swami Kriyananda. There will be a short period of group 
 meditation and then an informal time of questions. Shanti offers a depth o
 f wisdom and practical understanding of these teachings that comes from de
 cades of attunement\, practice and application of what Yogananda taught. E
 very answer is a class in itself - full of spiritual insight\, humor\, and
  warm hearted kindness.\n\nPlease submit questions ahead of time to: lorna
 @anandaportland.org\n\nShanti has been a close friend to our Portland sang
 ha for years and she is looking forward to spending time with us again.  
 She will be teaching a class on Friday\, Sept 26th and speaking at Sunday 
 service on September 28th.\n\nPlease register below and choose a sliding s
 cale amount.  You may also choose to pay at the temple before the event.
  \nAbout Shanti:\nNayaswami Shanti is a lifelong devotee and serves as on
 e of the spiritual directors of Ananda Palo Alto. Her talks are rich with 
 stories from her life as a physician and her many years on the path. With 
 her warmth and wisdom\, she is a much-loved counselor and teacher. She tea
 ches\, counsels and still maintains a practice of medicine through her coa
 ching practice of “Transformational Medicine.” Shanti’s talks online
 .
