SUMMARY:Fall Seva Day at the Temple
DESCRIPTION:All are welcome to our annual fall seva day - a day of service\
 , friendship and joy.\n\nSince we have shifted our activities away from th
 e community property on Vermont Court\, there is a lot of things to do at 
 the temple to accommodate the new energy there. We will be using this seva
  day to work inside and outside the temple.\n\nAll skill levels are encour
 aged to take part for all or part of the morning. Tentative schedule:\n\n8
 :30 treats and coffee\n\n8:45: morning circle\, assignments of jobs\n\n12:
 30: meditation\n\n1:00:  Lunch\n\n1:30: clean up
