SUMMARY:Independent Living Tours
DESCRIPTION:As part of our support to elders in our sangha\, we are offerin
 g opportunities to explore alternative living choices in our area. This is
  a chance to be with others as we check out options and consult with speci
 alists in the field of senior living and housing.\n\nWe will be having tou
 rs at Creekside and Beaverton Lodge Independent living on Oct 14th from 10
  am at Creekside and 11:15 at Beaverton Lodge. Please sign up if you want 
 to come. Lunch will be available at Beaverton Lodge.\n\nThese two faciliti
 es are very close to one another.\nRemember\, you may have a long time to 
 go before needing these services\, but what about your parents or other lo
 ved ones?\nCreekside Village 5450 SW Erickson Ave\, Beaverton Or. 503-643-
 9735\nBeaverton Lodge 12900 SW 9th st\, Beaverton OR. 503-6460635\n\nConta
 ct Nayaswami Hanuman Baughman with questions. 503-941-8323
