URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/celebrate-divine-light-with-sagar/
SUMMARY:“Living in Divine Light” Diwali Celebration
DESCRIPTION:\n\nJoin us for a special evening celebrating the traditional H
 indu holiday Diwali and the spiritual tradition of living in Divine Light.
  We'll incorporate chanting\, music\, storytelling and inspiration from ou
 r special guest Nayaswami Sagar into this beautiful program. Family-friend
 ly and experiential\, be sure to stay afterwards for sweets and refreshmen
 ts together!\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n************************************
 ****************************\n\n\n\nNayaswami Sagar resides in the Ananda 
 Monastery at Ananda Village\, California and is one of the lead teachers w
 ith Ananda online.\n\nSagar served Ananda’s work in India for seven year
 s and currently teaches online and in-person classes on a variety of topic
 s including meditation\, karma and reincarnation\, the yogic teachings of
  Jesus\, and more.\n\nBorn into a family of Kriya Yogis\, Sagar read the A
 utobiography of a Yogi at the young age of seven and has ever since been a
 n avid student of Paramhansa Yogananda’s teachings.\n\n&nbsp\;
