URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/aging-in-place-workshop/
SUMMARY:Aging in Place Workshop
DESCRIPTION:All are warmly invited to an informative and supportive convers
 ation about planning for the future. As we grow older and our needs evolve
 \, it’s important to understand the options available for senior living
 —and how to prepare thoughtfully for the choices ahead.  \n\nElaine Law
 rence is a Program Specialist with Washington County Disability\, Aging\, 
 and Veteran Services. She provides information\, referrals\, and long-term
  care planning for older adults and people with disabilities. Elaine’s p
 resentation will focus on aging in place\, covering topics such as in-home
  care services\, public programs like Medicaid\, home safety and accessibi
 lity\, financial assistance\, transportation and meal programs\, and how t
 o find and choose long-term care facilities.\nThere will be time for quest
 ions and a free light lunch will be served following the presentation.\n\n
 \n\nContact Nayaswami Hanuman Baughman with any questions.  phone: 503-94
 1-8323\n\nThis is a free event. Lunch is included so please RSVP.\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 25/10/aging.jpeg
