DTSTAMP:20251114T212013Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/healing-through-harmony/
SUMMARY:Healing Through Harmony: Transforming Emotions with Music
DESCRIPTION:&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nDiscover how Swami Kriyananda’s inspired music
  of Ananda can help transform heavy emotions into light and upliftment. Th
 rough guided listening\, group reflection\, and simple musical practices\,
  we’ll explore how melody\, rhythm\, and vibration can restore harmony t
 o the heart and peace to the mind. No musical experience needed—just an 
 open and willing heart.\n\nRegister below and choose a sliding scale ticke
 t. We look forward to sharing this special time with you.\n\nSatyaki Brock
 schmidt is a 30-year member of Ananda and a resident of Ananda Village\, h
 aving lived previously in Ananda Seattle and Ananda Portland. Since the ea
 rly 2000s\, and with Swami Kriyananda’s encouragement\, he’s been expl
 oring the inner effects of Ananda Music—how it affects consciousness and
  healing by resonating with and raising energy in the various spinal cente
 rs. You can learn more through his Ananda Music Oral History video\, http
 s://youtu.be/8gqO-DvJHJ0. He is working now to share the fruits of these l
 abors through classes\, videos\, and app experiences\, including Knowing G
 od through Ananda Music (https://youtu.be/tDauJOTlR74)\, recorded for Spir
 itual Renewal Week 2025.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 25/10/music-and-emotion.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Classes,Guest Speakers,music,workshop
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
