SUMMARY:Monthly Sangha Dinner
DESCRIPTION:\n\nWe invite you to join us on Fridays for a vegetarian fresh 
 cooked meal with Ananda sangha members. We enjoy good food and good compan
 y in our beautiful temple.\n\nThis month we will enjoy lemony lentil soup\
 , bread\, kale salad and a simple dessert with gluten free and vegan optio
 ns.\n\nEach meal is $7 for adults and $5 for children 12 and under.\n\nReg
 ister and let us know you are coming so we know how much to prepare!\n\nSt
 ay for our monthly kirtan after dinner - 7 PM (free).\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\
 ;\n\n&nbsp\;
