URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/kirtan-at-the-temple-12/
SUMMARY:Christmas Kirtan
DESCRIPTION:Kirtan is a shared time of devotional chanting\, with short per
 iods of meditation. Chanting is a spiritual practice that opens the heart 
 and allows for an experience of deep inner stillness and connection with t
 he divine presence within.\n\nWe will chant together in our beautiful temp
 le sanctuary during this holy season with a focus on Jesus\, the Christ an
 d the Universal Christ Consciousness.\n\nWho Was Jesus and Who Was The Ch
 rist?\nby Paramhansa Yogananda\n\n"Christ consciousness is the intelligen
 ce governing all finite Creation. Christ intelligence resides secretly in
  all the atoms of Creation and directs them to form into nebulae\, island 
 universes\, and solar systems\, and binds them with cords of thermal\, el
 ectro-magnetic\, gravitational rays\, and keeps them swimming and soaring 
 in the endless void of Eternity.\n\nJesus\, the man\, through step-by-step
  methods of Self-Realization\, freed His consciousness and Life Force from
  all body objects of material attachment\, such as muscles\, heart\, spina
 l plexuses\, brain\, and medulla\, and let them expand into the Cosmic ene
 rgy and Christ intelligence pervading all finite vibratory matter.\n\nJe
 sus and The Christ\n\nJesus\, the man\, could feel His consciousness and 
 Life Force pulsating in the space cells of His Cosmic material body as wel
 l as in the little body named Jesus. This expanded state of consciousness 
 is called Christ Consciousness."\n\n*************************************
 ***************************\n\nNo experience necessary!  We will share th
 e words to the chants\, which are usually in English and occasionally in S
 anskrit. Our musicians use harmoniums\, guitars and a harp.\n\nPlease come
  and join us for our monthly kirtans. All are welcome.\n\nThis is a free e
 vent.  Donations are appreciated.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nCome at 6 PM and take par
 t in our monthly Sangha Dinner and then chant with us after!\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 21/11/ChristChristmasaltar.jpg
CATEGORIES:Kirtan/Chanting
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
