URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/kriya-half-day-retreat/
SUMMARY:Kriya Half-Day Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Let's practice kriya and share kriya and discuss kriya together
 ! The path of kriya yoga is life-long and the rewards are abundant. The ch
 allenges are also many.  Our beloved community of kriyabans have a sacred
  duty to support one another and to share the spiritual practices as we jo
 urney to Self-Realization together.\n\nThis morning retreat will follow th
 is general flow:\n\n*6:30 AM:  Come early for optional EEs\, yoga\,\npra
 nayam\, maha mudra led by Badri\n\n7 AM:   Opening prayer\, chanting\n\
 n7 - 9 AM:  Meditation with some guided elements\n\n9 - 9: 45 AM:  Brunc
 h w/ tea and coffee\, fruit\, yogurt\, granola\, oatmeal \n\n9:45-11 Kri
 ya Inspiration and discussion led by Badri and Lorna\n\n11-11:30 Q&amp\;A\
 , practice and more discussion \n\n11:30  Meditation\n\n12  Closing Pra
 yer\n\nThis retreat is for Ananda Kriyabans. If you have questions about K
 riya initiation and the Path of Kriya Yoga at Ananda please contact us por
 tland@anandaportland.org\n\nPlease register below so we may plan for our m
 eal together.\n* Please let us know if payment is a hardship. We do not wa
 nt cost to be a barrier for anyone.\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 19/04/Kriya-Yoga-set-1.jpg
