URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/community-satsang-with-jyotish-and-d
 evi/
SUMMARY:Community Satsang with Jyotish and Devi
DESCRIPTION:Jyotish and Devi\, spiritual leaders of Ananda Worldwide\, will
  join us via Zoom in this community satsang. As Ananda Portland moves forw
 ard in a new expression of community\, this discussion will center on the 
 many possibilities for next steps.\n\nCommunity is a vital part of the tea
 chings of yoga and meditation that Yogananda brought to the west\, but the
  form is not fixed - divine energy can manifest in infinite variety. The v
 ision for the future of community here will come out of the devotees who a
 re committed to carrying the work of Ananda into the future and keeping th
 e light strong in service to all seekers.\n\nWe encourage everyone to join
  us for this satsang and future discussions about Ananda Portland\, our te
 mple and our community of souls.\n\nYou can register below and let us know
  you want to be part of the discussion.\n\n 	A follow-up satsang is planne
 d for Friday\, Jan 23 @ 7 PM\n\n&nbsp\;
