URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/community-satsang-2/
SUMMARY:Community Satsang #2
DESCRIPTION:This satsang is a follow-up to the one held last week with Jyot
 ish and Devi. The topic will be the future of community within Ananda Port
 land and who is interested in being an active part.\n\nAll are welcome who
  are interested in what Ananda Community will be in Portland/Beaverton.\n\
 nCommunity is a vital part of the teachings of yoga and meditation that Yo
 gananda brought to the west\, but the form is not fixed - divine energy ca
 n manifest in infinite variety. The vision for the future of community her
 e will come out of the devotees who are committed to carrying the work of 
 Ananda into the future and keeping the light strong in service to all seek
 ers.\n\nWe encourage everyone to join us for this satsang and future discu
 ssions about Ananda Portland\, our temple and our community of souls.\n\nY
 ou can register below and let us know you want to be part of the discussio
 n.\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 25/11/Screenshot_20251123-155536.jpg
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
