SUMMARY:Monthly Sangha Dinner
DESCRIPTION:\n\nWe invite you to join us for our monthly dinner at the temp
 le.\n\nThis month Srimati and Lorna will prepare a Mexican feast of tacos 
 and burritos with veggies. GF/V options.\n\nOn the Second Friday of each m
 onth we serve a vegetarian fresh cooked meal prepared by Ananda sangha mem
 bers. We enjoy good food and good company in our beautiful temple.\n\nEach
  meal is $7 for adults and $5 for children 12 and under.\n\nRegister and l
 et us know you are coming so we know how much to prepare!\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&n
 bsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
