 ng-light/
SUMMARY:Inner Renewal Retreat at the Expanding Light
DESCRIPTION:IRR takes place at the Expanding Light Retreat Center at Ananda
  Village in California. You can participate online for FREE or in person.
   Here in Portland we will show the morning classes streamed at the Portl
 and Temple. See that event listing HERE. \n\n****************************
 **************************************\n\nJoin us for Inner Renewal Retrea
 t 2026\, a week-long experience filled with inspiration\, practical tools\
 , and spiritual friendship guided by Ananda Worldwide’s Spiritual Direct
 ors\, Nayaswami Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi.\n\nThis Year’s Theme: Findin
 g Calmness and Joy in Turbulent Times\nWe’ll explore how calmness and jo
 y can become ever more steady inner companions—regardless of outer circu
 mstances.\n\nInner Renewal Retreat is both a meaningful entry point for th
 ose newer to Ananda’s path and a time of deepening and attunement for lo
 ng-time Ananda friends. Whether you join for a single session or the full 
 week\, you are welcome.\n\nYou can participate for free online or join in 
 person at Ananda Village.\n\nWe would love to have you with us!\n\nRegiste
 r for Inner Renewal Retreat 2026\n ananda.org/inner-renewal-retreat 
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/01/IRR-16-9-Image-with-Title.jpg
END:VEVENT
