SUMMARY:Yoga in Daily Life Series: Renew Your Meditation
DESCRIPTION:This Tuesday evening series of classes will present many aspect
 s of living the yogic life every day.\n\nThe teachings of yoga\, and speci
 fically\, the teachings of Paramhansa Yogananda\, are practical and applic
 able to every part of our lives. We will offer a variety of topics from yo
 ga philosophy and explore how we can deepen our understanding\, our practi
 ces and our spiritual growth through yoga.\n\nFebruary classes: \n\nFeb 3
  - Review of the Hong-Sau technique and how to deepen your practice\n\n(If
  you haven't learned the Hong-Sau technique\, you can sign up for our Lear
 n to Meditate series that is offered each month on Wednesday nights.  See
  our calendar HERE)\n\nFeb 10 - Review of the Aum technique and how to dee
 pen your practice (for disciples only)\n\nFeb 17 - Visualization and other
  tools to deepen and renew your meditation\n\nFeb 24 - Questions and Answe
 rs about meditation FREE\n\nLed by Lorna and Badri\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nCost: $15
  per class or $40 for the first 3 classes of the month.\n\nThe 4th Tuesday
  is FREE
