 ewal Retreat 2026\, a week-long experience filled with inspiration\, pract
 ical tools\, and spiritual friendship guided by Ananda Worldwide’s Spiri
 tual Directors\, Nayaswami Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi.\n\nThis Year’s Th
 eme: Finding Calmness and Joy in Turbulent Times\nWe’ll explore how calm
 ness and joy can become ever more steady inner companions—regardless of 
 outer circumstances.\n\nYou can participate for free online or join in per
 son at Ananda Village.\n\nRegister for the entire Inner Renewal Retreat 20
 26\n ananda.org/inner-renewal-retreat 
