SUMMARY:Secrets of Meditation: Renew your practice
DESCRIPTION:As part of our Renew Your Meditation series\, tonight's class w
 ill focus Secrets of Meditation by Swami Kriyananda.\n\nLet's explore thes
 e simple secrets for deepening and renewing our meditations. Each one has 
 the potential for revitalizing your meditation and renewing your practice 
 in a significant way.\n\nJoin Lorna for an inspiring evening exploration.\
 n\nThis class is FREE.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
