DTSTAMP:20260305T225307Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/mahasamadhi-meditation/
SUMMARY:Mahasamadhi Meditation
DESCRIPTION:On today's date in 1952 Yogananda consciously left his physical
  body\, entering the great samadhi\, or Mahasamadhi\, as all avatars do wh
 en their earthly mission ends.\n\nThis is a day to celebrate and an opport
 unity to commune with Yogananda in meditation\, drawing on his infinite co
 nsciousness and love.\n\nPlease join us during this morning meditation as 
 we pray\, chant and meditate together in our beautiful sanctuary. Yoganand
 a is ever with us and is lovingly calling us to our highest potential as d
 ivine beings.\n\nRead more in our blog -  Mahasamadhi: Yogananda's Eterna
 l Presence\n\nCome for all or part of the two hour meditation.
