SUMMARY:Seva Saturday
DESCRIPTION:Our temple is in transition with a major kitchen remodel coming
  up and a visit from the leaders of Ananda Worldwide.\n\nYou are invited t
 o help us move the energy and keep up with all the projects as the year pr
 ogresses. Inside and outside projects will be available for willing hands.
 \n\nThis Saturday we will be working outside painting the courtyard and po
 tting some garden plants as well as some inside painting\, cleaning and or
 ganizing.\n\nLight snacks will be available as we share in the fun.\n\nYou
  may register below and let us know you are coming.
