URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/money-magnetism-2026-03-03-2026-03-1
 0/
SUMMARY:Money Magnetism
DESCRIPTION:Money Magnetism: A Three-Part Class Series\nIn this three-class
  series based on Money Magnetism by J. Donald Walters (Swami Kriyananda)\,
  we will explore the spiritual principles behind abundance\, support\, and
  right relationship with money. Rather than focusing on techniques alone\,
  this series invites us to examine how consciousness\, attitude\, and alig
 nment influence material flow in our lives.\nEach class will explore a dif
 ferent aspect of money magnetism\, including:\n\n\n 	\nOur inner relations
 hip with money and abundance\n\n 	\nHow right attitude\, service\, and act
 ion affect material support\n\n 	\nTrust\, detachment\, and opening to div
 ine provision\n\n\nThis series is offered as a reflective\, spiritually gr
 ounded exploration and is open to anyone interested in bringing greater cl
 arity\, ease\, and faith to their relationship with money.\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/02/Money-Magnetism.jpeg
CATEGORIES:book study,Classes
LOCATION:Ananda Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, Oregon\, 97005
 \, 
