SUMMARY:Ananda Global Outreach Satsang
DESCRIPTION:\n🌍 Ananda’s Global Outreach: A Special Fundraising Event\
 nJoin us for an inspiring Satsang as the Ananda Fundraising Team visits ou
 r community to share how Ananda’s light is expanding around the world!\n
 Ananda’s mission continues to touch hearts globally\, spreading Yoganand
 a’s teachings of inner peace\, joy\, and divine connection. This special
  gathering will highlight:\n✨ The latest projects and initiatives from A
 nanda worldwide✨ How our community is making a difference✨ Ways we can
  support this sacred work together\nThis is an opportunity to feel deeply 
 connected to Ananda’s greater mission and discover how we can each play 
 a part in its growth.\nLet’s come together in support\, inspiration\, an
 d unity! Light refreshments will be served.\n&nbsp\;
