URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/superconscious-living-part-i/
SUMMARY:Superconscious Living Part I
DESCRIPTION:Join Badri for a transformative two-part Superconscious Living 
 series to deepen your meditation practice\, awaken  intuition\, and learn
  to live more deeply with divine inspiration and right action. \n \nTues
 day\, March 24 @ 7 PM:  Superconscious Living Part I: Inner Guidance &amp
 \; Attunement\nTuesday\, March 31 @ 7 PM: Superconscious Living Part II: R
 ight Action &amp\; Inner Freedom\n\nBoth classes are FREE. This is part of
  our "Yoga in Daily Life" series on Tuesdays.\n\n*\n\n"Superconscious livi
 ng means to trust one’s life to the flow of a higher wisdom. Superconsci
 ousness arranges things in ways that we might never imagine."  --Swami Kr
 iyananda\n\n*\n\n"You will attain superconsciousness more quickly if you s
 eek to attune yourself with it in your daily activities\, and not only in 
 meditation. The more you seek to be guided by intuition\, which is an aspe
 ct of superconsciousness\, the greater success you will meet in every unde
 rtaking."  --Swami Kriyananda\n\n\n\n\n\nSuperconscious Living Vow\nby Sw
 ami Kriyananda\n\n\nI vow from this day forth\nTo be true to my higher\, S
 uperconscious Self.\nTo be a channel of light\,\nOf blessing and love to a
 ll.\nTo live in Joy – not sorrow\;\nIn Truth – not error\;\nIn Victory
  – not failure.\nTo blame no one during adversity\nbut myself\;\nAnd the
 n\, instead of blame\,\nTo accept full responsibility\nWith God’s help\n
 For changing myself.\n\n\n
