URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/superconscious-living-part-ii/
SUMMARY:Superconscious Living Part II
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a transformative two-part Superconscious Living ser
 ies to deepen your meditation practice\, awaken  intuition\, and learn to
  live more deeply with divine inspiration and right action. \n \nTuesda
 y\, March 24 @ 7 PM:  Superconscious Living Part I: Inner Guidance &amp\;
  Attunement\nTuesday\, March 31 @ 7 PM: Superconscious Living Part II: Rig
 ht Action &amp\; Inner Freedom\n\nBoth classes are FREE. This is part of o
 ur "Yoga in Daily Life" series on Tuesdays.\n\nTaught by Badri Matlock\n\n
 "You will attain superconsciousness more quickly if you seek to attune you
 rself with it in your daily activities\, and not only in meditation. The m
 ore you seek to be guided by intuition\, which is an aspect of superconsci
 ousness\, the greater success you will meet in every undertaking."  SK\n\
 n"Superconscious living means to trust one’s life to the flow of a highe
 r wisdom. Superconsciousness arranges things in ways that we might never i
 magine."  SK\n\n\nSuperconscious Living Vow\nby Swami Kriyananda\n\n\nI v
 ow from this day forth\nTo be true o my higher\, Superconscious Self.\nTo 
 be a channel of light\,\nOf blessing and love to all.\nTo live in Joy – 
 not sorrow\;\nIn Truth – not error\;\nIn Victory – not failure.\nTo bl
 ame no one during adversity\nbut myself\;\nAnd then\, instead of blame\,\n
 To accept full responsibility\nWith God’s help\nFor changing myself.\n\n
 \n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/02/SunShining.jpg
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
