 6-03-04/
SUMMARY:Magnetize Your Life Through Ananda Yoga
DESCRIPTION:A 5‑Week Series on Willpower\, Concentration &amp\; Renewed E
 nthusiasm for Life\n\nSeries Overview\nThis 5‑week program blends Ananda
  Yoga\, yogic philosophy\, pranayama\, and meditation to help students awa
 ken their inner magnetism. Each session focuses on a specific aspect of pe
 rsonal energy—willpower\, concentration\, enthusiasm—and teaches stude
 nts how to direct that energy toward a more joyful\, purposeful life.\nEac
 h week includes:\n\n\n 	\nA theme &amp\; intention\n\n 	\nAnanda Yoga asan
 a\n\n 	\nAffirmations\n\n 	\nPranayama\n\n 	\nGuided visualization &amp\; 
 meditation\n\n\nWEEK 1 — Awakening Your Inner Magnetism\nWEEK 2 — Acce
 ssing Your Willpower\nWEEK 3 — Developing Deep Concentration\nWEEK 4 —
  Regaining Enthusiasm for Life\nWEEK 5 — Living a Magnetized Life\n\n\n 
 	Duration: 90 minutes\n 	What to Bring: Comfortable clothing\, a yoga mat
  (or borrow one at the Temple)\, and water.\n 	Cost per class : $15 regul
 ar/ Senior $10 (65+) you can get a session pack discount too!\n\nCome to a
 ll or any class.  Drop-ins are welcome!\n\nRegistration and prepayment is
  optional.\n\n&nbsp\;\nTaught by Melissa Heart\, AYT
