DESCRIPTION:Our temple is in transition with a major kitchen remodel coming
  up!\n\nYou are invited to help us move the energy and keep up with all th
 e projects as the year progresses. Inside and outside projects will be ava
 ilable for willing hands.\n\nThis Saturday we will be working inside and o
 utside. Painting\, cleaning\, gardening\, prepping and beautifying.\n\nLig
 ht snacks will be provided.\n\nYou may register below and let us know you 
 are coming.
