SUMMARY:Swami Kriyananda Moksha Meditation
DESCRIPTION: Swami Kriyananda left his body and obtained spiritual freedom\
 , moksha\, on this date in 2013.\n\nToday we celebrate his freedom in God 
 and we remember his divine friendship and his discipleship.\n\nOur morning
  meditation will have a special focus on Swami Kriyananda and include chan
 ting and readings for the occasion.\n\nAll are welcome.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nAn e
 vening event may be planned and the calendar will be updated.\n\n&nbsp\;
