URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/spring-womens-retreat/
SUMMARY:Spring Women's Retreat
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCome away to the sea.\n\nJoin us for a nourishi
 ng weekend retreat on the Oregon Coast — a gathering of women devotees o
 f Yogananda\, coming together to breathe\, create\, move\, and simply be
  in one another's company.\n\nThe ocean has always been a place of return
 . Let its rhythms carry you back to yourself.\n\n\n\nABOUT THE RETREAT\n\n
 This retreat is an invitation to slow down and go inward — supported by 
 the prana of the Pacific\, the warmth of Sangha sisterhood\, and a spaciou
 s weekend away from the demands of daily life.\n\nTogether we'll explore:\
 n\nMeditation — Daily group meditation to deepen your practice and reco
 nnect with Master's teachings in a space held by fellow devotees.\n\nYoga
  — Daily Ananda yoga sessions to open the body\, quiet the mind\, and m
 ove prana with intention.\n\nArt — Creative expression as spiritual pra
 ctice. No experience needed — only a willingness to play\, discover\, an
 d let something new come through.\n\nCommunity — Meals cooked and share
 d\, stories exchanged\, laughter\, silence\, and the particular joy of bei
 ng truly known by women who walk the same path.\n\n\n\nTHE DETAILS\n\nDate
 s: Weekend of April 24\, 2025\n\nLocation: Oregon Coast (Rockaway Beach)
 \n\nThe venue: Rockaway Beach House\n\nOpen to: Women devotees of Yoganan
 da\n\nCapacity: 15 women (limited enrollment)\n\nSleeping arrangements: 
  8 shared bedrooms\n\nAll meals included — vegetarian\, lovingly prepar
 ed\n\nInvestment: $250 per person\n\nTransportation:  Carpooling can be 
 arranged\n\n\n\nTHE FOOD\n\nAll meals are included and entirely vegetarian
  — nourishing\, fresh\, and prepared with care. Gluten Free and Vegan op
 tions available upon request. From morning chai to evening dinner\, food i
 s part of the retreat experience. Come hungry. Leave restored.\n\n\n\nWHO 
 THIS IS FOR\n\nThis retreat is for you if you're longing to:\n\n 	Reconnec
 t with your spiritual practices\n 	Be in community with women who understa
 nd the Ananda path\n 	Experience the restorative prana of the ocean\n 	Exp
 lore creativity as a form of devotion\n 	Rest\, replenish\, and return hom
 e renewed\n\n\n\n\nSpace is limited to 15 women. If you feel the call\, we
 'd love to have you with us.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nContact Gita Matlock (gita
 mcgilloway@gmail.com) or\n\nMelissa Heart (melissa27heart@gmail.com) if yo
 u have questions.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n   
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 25/02/IMG-20240901-WA0001-e1768593389913.jpg
END:VEVENT
