URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/mothers-day-sunday-service/
SUMMARY:Mother's Day Sunday Service
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Mother's Day Sunday Service. It is an opp
 ortunity to celebrate our one Divine Mother and the endless blessings of b
 eing Her divine children.\n\nToday is also the anniversary of the birth of
  the great master\, Sri Yukteswar.  Yukteswar was the guru of Paramhansa 
 Yogananda and an incarnation of Divine Wisdom.\n\nDivine Love and Divine W
 isdom: a sacred combination of divine attributes that help us awaken to ou
 r highest potential.\n\nSunday School for children 4 - 12 years will happe
 n during the 10 AM service.\n\nStay for our vegetarian potluck lunch after
  service!\n\n&nbsp\;
