SUMMARY:Shanti Garden Gala - Yogananda Community Fundraiser 
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an enchanted evening of delicious vegetarian cuisin
 e\, music and inspiration\, a charming children's play\, and divine friend
 ship including honored guests Jyotish and Devi.\n\nThis fundraiser will su
 pport our Yogananda Community Fund and our ongoing improvements to our Ana
 nda Portland Temple\, including our renovated Master's Kitchen\, Sangha Ha
 ll\, and Shanti Garden.\n\nThis will be a special not-to-miss evening of l
 aughter\, inspiration and friendship!\n\n
