DESCRIPTION:Join us June 5-7 for a special weekend of activities with Nayas
 wami Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi\, spiritual directors of Ananda Worldwide!
  They are wonderful spiritual teachers\, friends\, guides and global ambas
 sadors of peace and joy. Below is an overview of the weekend schedule - cl
 ick the link to sign up or learn more about specific events.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\
 nFriday\, June 5\n\n5:30-7pm - Shanti Garden Gala ~  Yogananda Community 
 Fundraiser: gourmet dinner\, music\, entertainment and inspiration\n\n$150
  per person / $250 per couple - help us continue to build spiritual commun
 ity and transform our beautiful Temple spaces!\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nSaturday\, Ju
 ne 6\n\n7 am-12:30 pm - Spiritual Community Half-Day Retreat with Jyotish 
 &amp\; Devi: featuring yoga\, meditation\, music\, food &amp\; inspiration
   ~ $40 person includes breakfast and snacks\n\n7 pm Q&amp\;A Satsang wit
 h Jyotish &amp\; Devi ~ Free Event\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nSunday\, June 7\n\n9 am F
 ire &amp\; Purification Ceremonies\, Peace &amp\; Harmony Meditation and P
 rayer with Jyotish &amp\; Devi\n\n10 am Sunday Service with Jyotish &amp\;
  Devi
