SUMMARY:Spiritual Community Half-Day Retreat with Jyotish and Devi
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special half-day retreat in our beautiful temple 
 celebrating the Ananda ideals of spiritual community and divine friendship
 !\n\nFeaturing special guests Jyotish and Devi\, who will share and help g
 uide this retreat\, we'll start with Energization Exercises\, chanting and
  meditation\, and have time for breakfast together as well as some yoga pr
 actices and sharing on the topic of spiritual community.\n\n\nTentative sc
 hedule:\n7-9am Sadhana: Energization Exercises\, brief yoga practice\, cha
 nting &amp\; meditation\n9-9:45 breakfast satsang: beginning in silence\, 
 we'll enjoy breakfast goodies\, coffee &amp\; tea\, fresh fruit and satsan
 g together\n9:45 chanting &amp\; music: singing together to open the heart
  and uplift our consciousness\n10-11:30 Spiritual Community with Jyotish &
 amp\; Devi: sharing inspiration\, questions &amp\; answers\n12-12:30 closi
 ng meditation and visualization on global peace &amp\; harmony
