SUMMARY:Q&A Satsang with Jyotish and Devi
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special evening of inspiration with Nayaswami Jyo
 tish and Nayaswami Devi\, spiritual directors of Ananda Worldwide\, gifted
  spiritual teachers\, divine friends and guides to thousands of devotees a
 round the world.\n\nWe are so fortunate and grateful to have them with us 
 for this weekend\, and our Saturday night event will be a relaxed Question
 s &amp\; Answers satsang full of inspiration\, humor\, deep wisdom and lov
 e.\n\nPlease register for this FREE event so we can best accommodate every
 one. We will devise a simple online format to submit questions in advance\
 , and live questions can be asked as well.\n\n
