SUMMARY:BBQ Potluck Independence Day Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Veggie Dogs and Burgers! We will provide the BBQ dogs and burge
 rs\, with buns and condiments. Please bring your favorite vegetarian side 
 dish or dessert to accompany the main dish.\n\nWe will have a PG Wodehouse
  Reader's Theater following our potluck - a wonderful day of satsang\, fri
 endship and freedom!\n\nAll are welcome.
