URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/kriyaban-retreat/
SUMMARY:Kriyaban Retreat
DESCRIPTION:🌟 Ananda Portland Kriya Retreat\n\nSeptember 25–27\, 2026
  \n\nColumbia River Gorge (Menucha Retreat)\n\n\nJoin us for a very speci
 al weekend retreat for Kriyabans in a breathtaking natural setting\, devot
 ed to deepening our spiritual practices and attuning ourselves to the bles
 sings of Kriya Yoga.\nHeld during the auspicious anniversary of Lahiri Mah
 asaya’s mahasamadhi\, this retreat is an opportunity to draw inward\, de
 epen our devotion\, and draw on the blessings of the Yoga Avatar and fathe
 r of Kriya Yoga in the modern age. Together\, we will strengthen our commi
 tment to live and share the light of Kriya Yoga in our lives.\nThis retrea
 t will be led by Badri and Lorna\, kriyacharyas and Spiritual Directors of
  Ananda Portland\, and will take place at the beautiful Menucha Retreat Ce
 nter in the Columbia River Gorge.\nThe weekend will include:\n\n\n 	\nGuid
 ed meditations and periods of silence\n\n 	\nKriya-focused inspiration and
  spiritual practice\n\n 	\nChanting and devotional gatherings\n\n 	\nShare
 d meals\, seva and community time\n\n 	\nOptional walks\, rest\, recreatio
 n and free time in nature\n\n\nAs summer shifts into fall\, join fellow de
 dicated Kriya Yogis for a sacred weekend of renewal\, deepening\, and divi
 ne friendship.\nCost: $265 per person (pay in full or $50 deposit up fron
 t\, full amount due by 9/1/26)Includes lodging at Menucha (shared accommod
 ations)\, all meals\, activities and retreat sessions.\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/02/Columbia-Gorge.jpg
END:VEVENT
