 itate and share in satsang (spiritual company). We chant and meditate firs
 t\, followed by some discussion and sharing.\n\nLed by ministers Gita Matl
 ock and Rose Neal. This event is held on the first Wednesday evening of ea
 ch month at our beautiful Ananda temple in Beaverton.\n\n[caption id="atta
 chment_7547269" align="alignleft" width="178"] Rose[/caption]\n\n[caption 
 id="attachment_16557736" align="alignleft" width="178"] Gita[/caption]\n\n
