SUMMARY:Christmas Decorating at the Temple
DESCRIPTION:All are welcome to join in the Christmas fun as we prepare the 
 temple for the holidays. There will be Christmas tree decorating along wit
 h cleaning and decorating the rest of the space. Lunch will be served.\n\n
 Families are invited to come at 11 am for special kid friendly activities.
 \n\nTimeline: \n\n10 am - Opening prayer and start the Christmas fun\n\n1
 1 am - 11:45 - Families have special activities together\n\n12 noon - 1 pm
  - Lunch will be served for all\n\n1 pm - 2 pm - finishing and clean up\nI
 t's your temple!  Come make it beautiful for Christmas!\nLet us know you 
 are coming and register below.
