URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/christ-has-come-christmas-concert/
SUMMARY:Christ Has Come! Christmas Concert
DESCRIPTION:A beautiful evening on Christmas music to share!  Please join 
 us as we celebrate this holy season with traditional carols and the uplift
 ing joyful music by Swami Kriyananda. The Ananda choir will sing and there
  will be participation from the children as well.\n\nChristmas is a specia
 l reason to celebrate the awakening of the Christ Consciousness in all sou
 ls. This free event is open to all and is family friendly.\n\nWe will foll
 ow the concert with satsang and snacks. Feel free to bring a vegetarian sw
 eet or savory snack to share. \n\n&nbsp\;\n\nThis event will NOT be live-
 streamed for public viewing. Contact us to request a private link. \n\n&n
 bsp\;\n\nCost:  FREE\nDonations are welcome at the event. Please register
  below just to let us know you are coming.\n\nWe look forward to being wit
 h you.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 23/12/Christmas-candles.jpg
