URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/paramhansa-yogananda-birthday-celebr
 ation-2027-01-05/
SUMMARY:Paramhansa Yogananda Birthday Celebration
DESCRIPTION:We begin the year and wrap up our holy season with the annivers
 ary of Paramhansa Yogananda's birth. On January 5\, 1893 the great master 
 of Self-Realization was born to lead the world into Dwapara Yuga\, an age 
 of energy and expansion of consciousness.\n\nOur celebration will include 
 music\, meditation\, chanting\, stories\, an inspirational slide show and 
 shared devotion and gratitude. We will also take part in a flower ceremony
  with an offering at the altar.\n\nJoin us in this beautiful evening of di
 vine love. All are welcome - whether new to the spiritual path or experien
 ced disciple.\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 20/12/Yogananda-Master-The-Ananda-Master-photo-292x400-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Devotional Event
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
